(46896, 813, 772, '<td valign="top">We have a depth of field issue in this shot.  It appears that only one of the ''chips'' is in good sharp focus.  Point and shoot cameras don''t usually focus and set aperture correctly for you in a shot like this.  This shot needs either manual focus (probably impossible) or aperture priority mode on your camera to allow a greater depth of field in your image.</td>', 'We have a depth of field issue in this shot.  It appears that only one of the ''chips'' is in good sharp focus.  Point and shoot cameras don''t usually focus and set aperture correctly for you in a shot like this.  This shot needs either manual focus (probably impossible) or aperture priority mode on your camera to allow a greater depth of field in your image.', '2002-04-15 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
