(46929, 815, 92, '<td valign="top">This is so calming to me for some reason. I think it''s the bottom ripples and dark background. I really like this capture. I do wonder how it would be just a LITTLE lighter. Nicely done !</td>', 'This is so calming to me for some reason. I think it''s the bottom ripples and dark background. I really like this capture. I do wonder how it would be just a LITTLE lighter. Nicely done !', '2002-04-15 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46930, 815, 656, '<td valign="top">scanned, or is your camera broken ?  Strange lines across the picture.  Cool shot none the less.  Bit dark/ grey/ out of focus though.</td>', 'scanned, or is your camera broken ?  Strange lines across the picture.  Cool shot none the less.  Bit dark/ grey/ out of focus though.', '2002-04-15 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(46931, 815, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I love the ''orbiting'' water drop off the main column of water.  At first, I didn''t like the contrast of this photo, but as I continue looking, I like the darkness here.  The darkenss conveys the actual turbulence in the water somewhat effectively :)  The only piece of this shot that I don''t like is at the bottom where the dark band crosses the photo.  I probably would have cropped this part out.  Very nice work!  Hmmm... As I continue looking at this shot, I am asking myself if I see vertical line pattern in the photo.  It appears that I do :(.  I am scoring this photo high just in case it is a good shot.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I love the ''orbiting'' water drop off the main column of water.  At first, I didn''t like the contrast of this photo, but as I continue looking, I like the darkness here.  The darkenss conveys the actual turbulence in the water somewhat effectively :)  The only piece of this shot that I don''t like is at the bottom where the dark band crosses the photo.  I probably would have cropped this part out.  Very nice work!  Hmmm... As I continue looking at this shot, I am asking myself if I see vertical line pattern in the photo.  It appears that I do :(.  I am scoring this photo high just in case it is a good shot.', '2002-04-15 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
