(47017, 820, 813, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, I like what you did with the reflected image of face and hands. Are those the same bunch of CD''s used in last weeks curves competition/ Bravo on the originality of your photo!!!</td>', 'Very nice composition, I like what you did with the reflected image of face and hands. Are those the same bunch of CD''s used in last weeks curves competition/ Bravo on the originality of your photo!!!', '2002-04-15 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47018, 820, 933, '<td valign="top">Probably the most interesting shot in the group.  I have to keep looking at this to figure out what score to give it.  Very very interesting shot.  Nice work!</td>', 'Probably the most interesting shot in the group.  I have to keep looking at this to figure out what score to give it.  Very very interesting shot.  Nice work!', '2002-04-15 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47019, 820, 772, '<td valign="top">I need some help from you.  #1 - I don''t really understand this photo.  If you could tell me a little about how it was done, I could possibly adjust my score...</td>', 'I need some help from you.  #1 - I don''t really understand this photo.  If you could tell me a little about how it was done, I could possibly adjust my score...', '2002-04-15 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47020, 820, 387, '<td valign="top">Cool use of the images on the compact discs to add interest.</td>', 'Cool use of the images on the compact discs to add interest.', '2002-04-15 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47021, 820, 527, '<td valign="top">Winner! Very original. I even know how you did it and I bet the original looks super cool. I had a very unique way of pulling mine off too except nobody knew to ask anything and it wasn''t as clever as yours. I just hope people don''t put this down thinking it was scanned because I know it wasn''t. Excellent job.<br/></td>', 'Winner! Very original. I even know how you did it and I bet the original looks super cool. I had a very unique way of pulling mine off too except nobody knew to ask anything and it wasn''t as clever as yours. I just hope people don''t put this down thinking it was scanned because I know it wasn''t. Excellent job.', '2002-04-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47022, 820, 714, '<td valign="top">This is so awesome.  I am not sure how to respond to this.  Just one question.  How?  I love the guys look!</td>', 'This is so awesome.  I am not sure how to respond to this.  Just one question.  How?  I love the guys look!', '2002-04-15 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
