(47024, 820, 1085, '<td valign="top">what''s this supposed to be..... nice job by the way... it''s very creative and very colorful...almost too colorful... almost makes you wonder how someone pulled this off.....hmmmmmmmmmm.</td>', 'what''s this supposed to be..... nice job by the way... it''s very creative and very colorful...almost too colorful... almost makes you wonder how someone pulled this off.....hmmmmmmmmmm.', '2002-04-15 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47025, 820, 724, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how this was done! Doesn''t seem possible!</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how this was done! Doesn''t seem possible!', '2002-04-15 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47026, 820, 1, '<td valign="top">Lots of colors and a very busy image.  There''s always new things to find when looking at this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Lots of colors and a very busy image.  There''s always new things to find when looking at this shot.  Well done.', '2002-04-16 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47027, 820, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.  One of my top 3 photos.  Great color, composition, lots of movement expressed, even the image of the women in the water.  This almost gives me the impression of a photoshopped image but I know thats against the rules so the technical merit here makes this my second favorite photo.</td>', 'Very unusual.  One of my top 3 photos.  Great color, composition, lots of movement expressed, even the image of the women in the water.  This almost gives me the impression of a photoshopped image but I know thats against the rules so the technical merit here makes this my second favorite photo.', '2002-04-16 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47028, 820, 2, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m completely lost -- you need to post some pictures of your setup here, so we can see how to create an image so chaotic.  Very nice job, and excellent creativity.</td>', 'Wow.  I''m completely lost -- you need to post some pictures of your setup here, so we can see how to create an image so chaotic.  Very nice job, and excellent creativity.', '2002-04-16 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
