(47030, 820, 441, '<td valign="top">nowt''  tranquile about this mayhem scene - superb colours'' composition and impact that most of the other submissions have missed by a mile! - seem to recognise those CD''s from soewhere though?</td>', 'nowt''  tranquile about this mayhem scene - superb colours'' composition and impact that most of the other submissions have missed by a mile! - seem to recognise those CD''s from soewhere though?', '2002-04-16 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
