(47055, 820, 1066, '<td valign="top">A great photo.<br/><br/>I didn''t know exatly what the shiny objects were but it didn''t affect my love for the imagery.<br/><br/>Now that I know that the objects were cd''s I really apreciate the technical merits of the photo.<br/><br/>I had this as one of my 3 best and was suprised so many rated it below average.  do you guys actually take photographs?</td>', 'A great photo.I didn''t know exatly what the shiny objects were but it didn''t affect my love for the imagery.Now that I know that the objects were cd''s I really apreciate the technical merits of the photo.I had this as one of my 3 best and was suprised so many rated it below average.  do you guys actually take photographs?', '2002-04-22 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
