(47293, 829, 142, '<td valign="top">This photo would really stand out more with a different type of lighting.  The natural light creates too many shadows and makes the water too bright.  Otherwise I really like the way you captured the drips of the water into the glass.  You have a good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'This photo would really stand out more with a different type of lighting.  The natural light creates too many shadows and makes the water too bright.  Otherwise I really like the way you captured the drips of the water into the glass.  You have a good interpretation of the challenge.', '2002-04-16 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
