(47342, 833, 772, '<td valign="top">You chose a difficult subject to work with on stopped motion.  Feathers at a distance like this are blurring and there isn''t much you can do to stop it.  The tassles on the costume seem to be stopped fairly well.  The subject being off center with the granstand viewers off to the side make this a challenging framing situation as well.</td>', 'You chose a difficult subject to work with on stopped motion.  Feathers at a distance like this are blurring and there isn''t much you can do to stop it.  The tassles on the costume seem to be stopped fairly well.  The subject being off center with the granstand viewers off to the side make this a challenging framing situation as well.', '2002-04-15 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
