(47344, 833, 92, '<td valign="top">AWESOME choice:) My only critque is the busy area around the dancer distracts from him. However, I love it !</td>', 'AWESOME choice:) My only critque is the busy area around the dancer distracts from him. However, I love it !', '2002-04-15 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47345, 833, 301, '<td valign="top">background is too distracting for my liking</td>', 'background is too distracting for my liking', '2002-04-15 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47346, 833, 641, '<td valign="top">The colors are great in this. And the stop action is good. The people in back are distracting though, but it''s tough in instances like that to not get them.</td>', 'The colors are great in this. And the stop action is good. The people in back are distracting though, but it''s tough in instances like that to not get them.', '2002-04-15 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47347, 833, 203, '<td valign="top">So much more original "person" shot than the others.  Thanks for not boring me with another "friend in street clothes" jumping up.</td>', 'So much more original "person" shot than the others.  Thanks for not boring me with another "friend in street clothes" jumping up.', '2002-04-15 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47348, 833, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.. I would have liked to see the shot without the speaker.</td>', 'Nice photo.. I would have liked to see the shot without the speaker.', '2002-04-15 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47349, 833, 885, '<td valign="top">there probably wasn''t anything you could have done about it, but the background is distracting</td>', 'there probably wasn''t anything you could have done about it, but the background is distracting', '2002-04-15 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47350, 833, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wish the audience hadn''t looked away just then. Or maybe they are meant to mirror the cones one the other side...</td>', 'I wish the audience hadn''t looked away just then. Or maybe they are meant to mirror the cones one the other side...', '2002-04-15 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47351, 833, 661, '<td valign="top">Colorful.  Slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Colorful.  Slightly out of focus.', '2002-04-15 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47352, 833, 527, '<td valign="top">I feel it needs tighter cropping and a more unique perspective to eliminate the distracting background. The backgrounds can really hinder a great opportunity.</td>', 'I feel it needs tighter cropping and a more unique perspective to eliminate the distracting background. The backgrounds can really hinder a great opportunity.', '2002-04-15 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47353, 833, 142, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I wish I could see the whole dance.  Great photo!</td>', 'Cool!  I wish I could see the whole dance.  Great photo!', '2002-04-15 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47354, 833, 842, '<td valign="top">wow... really nice fancy dancer. where was this taken?</td>', 'wow... really nice fancy dancer. where was this taken?', '2002-04-15 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47355, 833, 1, '<td valign="top">Not sure how fitting the background is.  I suppose the unamused crowd is an interesting touch.</td>', 'Not sure how fitting the background is.  I suppose the unamused crowd is an interesting touch.', '2002-04-15 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47356, 833, 245, '<td valign="top">I wish the costume didn''t collide with and get lost in the croud behind it, I would have tried finding a different angle if it had been possible. You could get rid of a lot of distracting background (the people are looking off the frame) by framing it vertically.</td>', 'I wish the costume didn''t collide with and get lost in the croud behind it, I would have tried finding a different angle if it had been possible. You could get rid of a lot of distracting background (the people are looking off the frame) by framing it vertically.', '2002-04-16 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47357, 833, 113, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  Too bad you couldn''t get him by himself.  The people and the cones take away from your main attraction.</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  Too bad you couldn''t get him by himself.  The people and the cones take away from your main attraction.', '2002-04-16 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47358, 833, 1066, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  I would have rated higher if you could have gotten a tighter shot on the dancer and eliminated the background stuff to a greater degree.  Also get some fill light on the front of the dancer.</td>', 'Great subject.  I would have rated higher if you could have gotten a tighter shot on the dancer and eliminated the background stuff to a greater degree.  Also get some fill light on the front of the dancer.', '2002-04-16 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47359, 833, 446, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were in the right place at the right time.  As constructive criticism, it probably would have been a little more pleasing to my eye if you would have used a veritcal crop, as the background tends to dominate the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Looks like you were in the right place at the right time.  As constructive criticism, it probably would have been a little more pleasing to my eye if you would have used a veritcal crop, as the background tends to dominate the shot.  Nice work.', '2002-04-16 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47360, 833, 910, '<td valign="top">Nice, too bad there is so much clutter in the background.</td>', 'Nice, too bad there is so much clutter in the background.', '2002-04-16 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47361, 833, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Cutting out some of the background (people, cones, etc.) would''ve been good.  Guy with paper looks thrilled.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Cutting out some of the background (people, cones, etc.) would''ve been good.  Guy with paper looks thrilled.', '2002-04-17 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47362, 833, 441, '<td valign="top">nice colourful shot - traffic cones not kind to this pic.</td>', 'nice colourful shot - traffic cones not kind to this pic.', '2002-04-17 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47363, 833, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent colors. crisp!  you can see his stuff is moving around all good.</td>', 'excellent colors. crisp!  you can see his stuff is moving around all good.', '2002-04-17 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47364, 833, 361, '<td valign="top">Good looking photo. I would like it better if the dancer had been facing the sun.</td>', 'Good looking photo. I would like it better if the dancer had been facing the sun.', '2002-04-17 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47365, 833, 2, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject -- it really gave you awesome colors and excitement.  Were there any better angles you could have gotten to get a less distracting background?</td>', 'Great choice of subject -- it really gave you awesome colors and excitement.  Were there any better angles you could have gotten to get a less distracting background?', '2002-04-18 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47366, 833, 205, '<td valign="top">sad exploitation of the native american</td>', 'sad exploitation of the native american', '2002-04-18 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47367, 833, 587, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the bleachers ''disappear'', and the cones too - atleast make me feel like I''m not gawing at an Indian dancer in a parking lot. bonus pts. for originality :)</td>', 'Would like to see the bleachers ''disappear'', and the cones too - atleast make me feel like I''m not gawing at an Indian dancer in a parking lot. bonus pts. for originality :)', '2002-04-18 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47368, 833, 862, '<td valign="top">If possible, shoot with the sun at your back to provide better lighting on the subject.</td>', 'If possible, shoot with the sun at your back to provide better lighting on the subject.', '2002-04-18 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47369, 833, 797, '<td valign="top">nice colors.</td>', 'nice colors.', '2002-04-19 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47370, 833, 1041, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and subject matter, however, the background is distracting with the orange cones and all.  Some cropping (maybe turning it into a portrait format) would have been helpful.</td>', 'Cool idea and subject matter, however, the background is distracting with the orange cones and all.  Some cropping (maybe turning it into a portrait format) would have been helpful.', '2002-04-19 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47371, 833, 1175, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great stop motion.  The position the subject is in does not give a strong impression that it was moving.</td>', 'This could have been a great stop motion.  The position the subject is in does not give a strong impression that it was moving.', '2002-04-19 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47372, 833, 1202, '<td valign="top">Lots of motion still in this colorful shot.</td>', 'Lots of motion still in this colorful shot.', '2002-04-20 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(47373, 833, 637, '<td valign="top">great colors, but where''s the motion?</td>', 'great colors, but where''s the motion?', '2002-04-20 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47374, 833, 139, '<td valign="top">I love the energy portrayed here.</td>', 'I love the energy portrayed here.', '2002-04-20 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47375, 833, 933, '<td valign="top">Too much competing for attnetion here - the cones in the background, the onlookers, the speaker, etc.</td>', 'Too much competing for attnetion here - the cones in the background, the onlookers, the speaker, etc.', '2002-04-21 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47376, 833, 889, '<td valign="top">nice colors to bad the row of parking cones is there Congradulations on something other than water droplets</td>', 'nice colors to bad the row of parking cones is there Congradulations on something other than water droplets', '2002-04-21 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47377, 833, 806, '<td valign="top">crop in tight around subject... and focus on face.</td>', 'crop in tight around subject... and focus on face.', '2002-04-21 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47378, 834, 92, '<td valign="top">There''s just too much blur:( Fans are hard to capture without motion. Just a bit too dark, also.</td>', 'There''s just too much blur:( Fans are hard to capture without motion. Just a bit too dark, also.', '2002-04-15 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47379, 834, 156, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2002-04-15 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47380, 834, 656, '<td valign="top">Good artistic shot of a boring subject :)  You did well, but it shows lots of motion blur...</td>', 'Good artistic shot of a boring subject :)  You did well, but it shows lots of motion blur...', '2002-04-15 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47381, 834, 189, '<td valign="top">Little bit of blur there.</td>', 'Little bit of blur there.', '2002-04-15 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47382, 834, 279, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very boring, simple shot. But the shutter speed you used, making it dark and only a little blurry, really makes it fascinating. More towards the center would''ve been better, that''s my only nitpick.</td>', 'This could have been a very boring, simple shot. But the shutter speed you used, making it dark and only a little blurry, really makes it fascinating. More towards the center would''ve been better, that''s my only nitpick.', '2002-04-15 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47383, 834, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting look at a fan, the goal was no motion blurs though! = P</td>', 'Interesting look at a fan, the goal was no motion blurs though! = P', '2002-04-15 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47384, 834, 203, '<td valign="top">I am sure it was hard trying to freeze the hub spokes while allowing the blades enough blurr to show motion.  This shot does not deserve all the "ones" it will surely get because of that blurr.</td>', 'I am sure it was hard trying to freeze the hub spokes while allowing the blades enough blurr to show motion.  This shot does not deserve all the "ones" it will surely get because of that blurr.', '2002-04-15 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47385, 834, 661, '<td valign="top">I still see motion on the blades.</td>', 'I still see motion on the blades.', '2002-04-15 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47386, 834, 772, '<td valign="top">This is going to be a challenging comment, so please bear with me.  A vast majority of the motion in this photo is not "stopped".  The only moving parts that appear to be remotely stationary are the metal arms that hold the blades to the fixture, and the fixture itself.  The inner spikes just outside the light are stationary to begin with.  I like the artistic qualities of this photo but I don''t think it''s a good representation of the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is going to be a challenging comment, so please bear with me.  A vast majority of the motion in this photo is not "stopped".  The only moving parts that appear to be remotely stationary are the metal arms that hold the blades to the fixture, and the fixture itself.  The inner spikes just outside the light are stationary to begin with.  I like the artistic qualities of this photo but I don''t think it''s a good representation of the challenge topic.', '2002-04-15 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47387, 834, 527, '<td valign="top">You were obviously going for something abstract here but we were supposed to avoid motion blur. Perhaps a much faster shutter speed and tying something pretty to each blade to show the frozen motion. Hmmm, Frozen Motion, wish I would have thought of that name for my entry.</td>', 'You were obviously going for something abstract here but we were supposed to avoid motion blur. Perhaps a much faster shutter speed and tying something pretty to each blade to show the frozen motion. Hmmm, Frozen Motion, wish I would have thought of that name for my entry.', '2002-04-15 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47388, 834, 441, '<td valign="top">sorry this image has not been stopped dead</td>', 'sorry this image has not been stopped dead', '2002-04-15 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47389, 834, 813, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the action is more frozen near the hub of the fan and more blurred near the ends. Still it needs something more to be a compelling image.</td>', 'Interesting how the action is more frozen near the hub of the fan and more blurred near the ends. Still it needs something more to be a compelling image.', '2002-04-15 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47390, 834, 724, '<td valign="top">too much blur, bummer.</td>', 'too much blur, bummer.', '2002-04-15 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47391, 834, 352, '<td valign="top">A bit too much motion blur for "stopped motion"</td>', 'A bit too much motion blur for "stopped motion"', '2002-04-15 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47392, 834, 245, '<td valign="top">This would be a lot more interesting to me if it weren''t slightly off center... it either needs to be precisely in the middle or offset some more. It''s a nice abstract shot, though!</td>', 'This would be a lot more interesting to me if it weren''t slightly off center... it either needs to be precisely in the middle or offset some more. It''s a nice abstract shot, though!', '2002-04-16 04:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47393, 834, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but blades shouldn''t be so fuzzy in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice image, but blades shouldn''t be so fuzzy in this challenge.', '2002-04-16 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47394, 834, 878, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the shot however, its a blurred stop motion shot.</td>', 'I like the feel of the shot however, its a blurred stop motion shot.', '2002-04-16 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47395, 834, 2, '<td valign="top">I''d redo the crop here to get the centering right.  Cool lighting, though.</td>', 'I''d redo the crop here to get the centering right.  Cool lighting, though.', '2002-04-16 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47396, 834, 1103, '<td valign="top">great use of lighting! really creative angle</td>', 'great use of lighting! really creative angle', '2002-04-16 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47397, 834, 748, '<td valign="top">My eyes couldn''t decide whether to focus on the cieling or the blades.. I can tell that these blades were in motion, which doesn''t really meet the challenge.  Tough subject for "Stop the motion".</td>', 'My eyes couldn''t decide whether to focus on the cieling or the blades.. I can tell that these blades were in motion, which doesn''t really meet the challenge.  Tough subject for "Stop the motion".', '2002-04-16 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47398, 834, 258, '<td valign="top">I still see a little motion blur.  ;-)</td>', 'I still see a little motion blur.  ;-)', '2002-04-16 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47399, 834, 301, '<td valign="top">interesting effect</td>', 'interesting effect', '2002-04-17 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47400, 834, 472, '<td valign="top">this is one of the pretties pics in the challenge. the blur adds to the impression of motion.  nice.</td>', 'this is one of the pretties pics in the challenge. the blur adds to the impression of motion.  nice.', '2002-04-17 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47401, 834, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows, but a little too blurry.</td>', 'Good use of shadows, but a little too blurry.', '2002-04-17 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47402, 834, 749, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, but too much motion blur.</td>', 'Interesting angle, but too much motion blur.', '2002-04-17 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47403, 834, 933, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, at least, I see.  It''s a fan.  It is indeeed an interesting shot, but unfotunately it is not a very well defined stop motion shot.  Had to grade it down for that - sorry.</td>', 'Ahhh, at least, I see.  It''s a fan.  It is indeeed an interesting shot, but unfotunately it is not a very well defined stop motion shot.  Had to grade it down for that - sorry.', '2002-04-17 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47404, 834, 1138, '<td valign="top">Excessive blur in image.  Doesn''t meet challenge requirements.</td>', 'Excessive blur in image.  Doesn''t meet challenge requirements.', '2002-04-17 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47405, 834, 205, '<td valign="top">I see motion trails yet this is more favorable than the other fan shot</td>', 'I see motion trails yet this is more favorable than the other fan shot', '2002-04-18 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47406, 834, 587, '<td valign="top">wish the lighing was lighter, good job though. You really get the feeling of the fan being on, I know I can''t stare at the center - which is where your eye is drawn - I feel motion sick!</td>', 'wish the lighing was lighter, good job though. You really get the feeling of the fan being on, I know I can''t stare at the center - which is where your eye is drawn - I feel motion sick!', '2002-04-18 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47407, 834, 862, '<td valign="top">You need a faster shutter speed to really stop the action.</td>', 'You need a faster shutter speed to really stop the action.', '2002-04-18 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47408, 834, 1041, '<td valign="top">Kind of a cool picture, however, the motion is not stopped.</td>', 'Kind of a cool picture, however, the motion is not stopped.', '2002-04-18 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47409, 834, 543, '<td valign="top">So cliché.  Action not stopped.  Bare bulb.  Still, somehow compelling.</td>', 'So cliché.  Action not stopped.  Bare bulb.  Still, somehow compelling.', '2002-04-18 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47410, 834, 797, '<td valign="top">why not crop it in?</td>', 'why not crop it in?', '2002-04-19 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47411, 834, 1175, '<td valign="top">Don''t like it.</td>', 'Don''t like it.', '2002-04-19 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47412, 834, 361, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this shot doesn''t really stop the motion. Difficult to do in a low-light situation.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this shot doesn''t really stop the motion. Difficult to do in a low-light situation.', '2002-04-19 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47413, 834, 1, '<td valign="top">I''d say that this motion isn''t stopped at all.  Try a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'I''d say that this motion isn''t stopped at all.  Try a faster shutter speed.', '2002-04-19 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47414, 834, 1202, '<td valign="top">Motion is still not stopped.  Trails in blades.</td>', 'Motion is still not stopped.  Trails in blades.', '2002-04-20 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47415, 834, 637, '<td valign="top">too dark to appreciate... too many trails</td>', 'too dark to appreciate... too many trails', '2002-04-20 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47416, 834, 346, '<td valign="top">Loved the shot. Great angle. but, the purpose was to stop action and have no blurs.</td>', 'Loved the shot. Great angle. but, the purpose was to stop action and have no blurs.', '2002-04-20 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47417, 834, 739, '<td valign="top">The blurring of the fan gives the impression of motion, but the challenged is "stopped motion."</td>', 'The blurring of the fan gives the impression of motion, but the challenged is "stopped motion."', '2002-04-20 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47418, 834, 139, '<td valign="top">Although I didn''t mark it down for the motion blur, I feel as though you should have tried to conform to the challenge wording a little better.  Good photo.</td>', 'Although I didn''t mark it down for the motion blur, I feel as though you should have tried to conform to the challenge wording a little better.  Good photo.', '2002-04-20 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47419, 835, 107, '<td valign="top">excellent texture</td>', 'excellent texture', '2002-04-15 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47420, 835, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and well taken shot.  Just isn''t very interesting I''m afraid.</td>', 'Nice framing and well taken shot.  Just isn''t very interesting I''m afraid.', '2002-04-15 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47421, 835, 885, '<td valign="top">Kinda creepy, looks like clear jelly, I like it</td>', 'Kinda creepy, looks like clear jelly, I like it', '2002-04-15 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47422, 835, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Even though there are a lot of water shots, this one is not quite the same as all the others.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Even though there are a lot of water shots, this one is not quite the same as all the others.', '2002-04-15 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47423, 835, 139, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, though I''m not fond of the composition.</td>', 'Pretty good, though I''m not fond of the composition.', '2002-04-15 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47424, 835, 641, '<td valign="top">Good job, the lighting adds to it.</td>', 'Good job, the lighting adds to it.', '2002-04-15 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47425, 835, 772, '<td valign="top">The water in this photo needs a little additonal contrast from the background to really bring out the stopped motion.</td>', 'The water in this photo needs a little additonal contrast from the background to really bring out the stopped motion.', '2002-04-15 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47426, 835, 138, '<td valign="top">water.. go figure</td>', 'water.. go figure', '2002-04-15 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47427, 835, 782, '<td valign="top">This photo is so busy, can''t tell if all motion is stopped or not.</td>', 'This photo is so busy, can''t tell if all motion is stopped or not.', '2002-04-15 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47428, 835, 131, '<td valign="top">more water</td>', 'more water', '2002-04-15 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47429, 835, 113, '<td valign="top">Is IT down there??  I probably wouldn''t put this on my wall, but I like the captured bubble or droplets gathered in the middle.</td>', 'Is IT down there??  I probably wouldn''t put this on my wall, but I like the captured bubble or droplets gathered in the middle.', '2002-04-16 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
