(47545, 838, 933, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  Very crisp.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the colors.  Very crisp.  Nice shot.', '2002-04-17 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47546, 838, 554, '<td valign="top">good job. I would have cropped the upper group of rocks</td>', 'good job. I would have cropped the upper group of rocks', '2002-04-17 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47547, 838, 1061, '<td valign="top">busy bg, otherwise OK</td>', 'busy bg, otherwise OK', '2002-04-18 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47548, 838, 640, '<td valign="top">Cool! Is this a geyser?</td>', 'Cool! Is this a geyser?', '2002-04-18 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47549, 838, 671, '<td valign="top">good focus, nice colors. It looks like eastern Washington?</td>', 'good focus, nice colors. It looks like eastern Washington?', '2002-04-18 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47550, 838, 245, '<td valign="top">those are some crazy rocks! where is this?</td>', 'those are some crazy rocks! where is this?', '2002-04-18 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47551, 838, 797, '<td valign="top">you threw in a rock didn''t you? it''s a lovely place to photograph.</td>', 'you threw in a rock didn''t you? it''s a lovely place to photograph.', '2002-04-19 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47552, 838, 811, '<td valign="top">A different crop may have made it more interesting.</td>', 'A different crop may have made it more interesting.', '2002-04-19 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47553, 838, 1175, '<td valign="top">The water thing is overdone.   But I do like the background.</td>', 'The water thing is overdone.   But I do like the background.', '2002-04-19 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47554, 838, 1202, '<td valign="top">Similar to another picture this week but it doesn''t geve me the same reaction.   Sure you stopped the splash, but it is missing something for me.</td>', 'Similar to another picture this week but it doesn''t geve me the same reaction.   Sure you stopped the splash, but it is missing something for me.', '2002-04-20 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47555, 838, 1135, '<td valign="top">Love the Blue in the water.</td>', 'Love the Blue in the water.', '2002-04-21 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47556, 838, 1, '<td valign="top">Centering and fillling the frame with the splash would''ve been better off I think.</td>', 'Centering and fillling the frame with the splash would''ve been better off I think.', '2002-04-21 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47557, 838, 806, '<td valign="top">i wonder what this would look like cropped tighter in?</td>', 'i wonder what this would look like cropped tighter in?', '2002-04-21 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47558, 840, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of the challenge topic.  I also really like the texture you have captured on the fence pole and the fence itself.  I don''t believe I can comment on how you could improve this particular photograph. Maybe a more dramatic subject.  I know this was a diffucult challenge.  I had a hard time with my subject as well.</td>', 'This is a good example of the challenge topic.  I also really like the texture you have captured on the fence pole and the fence itself.  I don''t believe I can comment on how you could improve this particular photograph. Maybe a more dramatic subject.  I know this was a diffucult challenge.  I had a hard time with my subject as well.', '2002-04-15 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47559, 840, 138, '<td valign="top">i think this is one of the more creative of this challenge</td>', 'i think this is one of the more creative of this challenge', '2002-04-15 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47560, 840, 1055, '<td valign="top">very interesting.  a picture like this makes me want to sit down and ponder about symbolism.  great job!</td>', 'very interesting.  a picture like this makes me want to sit down and ponder about symbolism.  great job!', '2002-04-15 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47561, 840, 641, '<td valign="top">Good color and an interesting shot.</td>', 'Good color and an interesting shot.', '2002-04-15 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47562, 840, 656, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  LIke it a lot - Maybe the fence would have been a more interesting backdrop than the trees ?  not sure.</td>', 'cool shot.  LIke it a lot - Maybe the fence would have been a more interesting backdrop than the trees ?  not sure.', '2002-04-15 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47563, 840, 139, '<td valign="top">This is certainly my favorite shot.  Great idea, great execution.  I love the focus, the colors... everything.  Good title, too, though I would have enjoyed it much more if I had been forced to figure it out myself.  It''s too bad so many people won''t get it.</td>', 'This is certainly my favorite shot.  Great idea, great execution.  I love the focus, the colors... everything.  Good title, too, though I would have enjoyed it much more if I had been forced to figure it out myself.  It''s too bad so many people won''t get it.', '2002-04-15 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47564, 840, 734, '<td valign="top">this really says allot,.. great job</td>', 'this really says allot,.. great job', '2002-04-15 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47565, 840, 189, '<td valign="top">Like the title....</td>', 'Like the title....', '2002-04-15 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47566, 840, 279, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been better if there was some idea of what the tape was for... Just having a caution tape in a field doesn''t make much sense, it leaves me sorta wondering what''s going on.</td>', 'This would''ve been better if there was some idea of what the tape was for... Just having a caution tape in a field doesn''t make much sense, it leaves me sorta wondering what''s going on.', '2002-04-15 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47567, 840, 885, '<td valign="top">cute title</td>', 'cute title', '2002-04-15 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47568, 840, 933, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Very unique.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Very unique.', '2002-04-15 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47569, 840, 714, '<td valign="top">simple, but good</td>', 'simple, but good', '2002-04-15 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47570, 840, 782, '<td valign="top">I like the title.  Good exposure</td>', 'I like the title.  Good exposure', '2002-04-15 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47571, 840, 724, '<td valign="top">Great title, original concept, in a sea of water drops!</td>', 'Great title, original concept, in a sea of water drops!', '2002-04-15 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47572, 840, 881, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept!</td>', 'Interesting concept!', '2002-04-16 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(47573, 840, 878, '<td valign="top">Very nice, you almost feel the cool breeze.</td>', 'Very nice, you almost feel the cool breeze.', '2002-04-16 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47574, 840, 813, '<td valign="top">looks like it could be an editorial photo for a story on trouble at the ball fields or something. nicely focussed, composed etc</td>', 'looks like it could be an editorial photo for a story on trouble at the ball fields or something. nicely focussed, composed etc', '2002-04-16 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47575, 840, 441, '<td valign="top">good image well stopped</td>', 'good image well stopped', '2002-04-16 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47576, 840, 255, '<td valign="top">cool picture--(and cool title!) i like this.</td>', 'cool picture--(and cool title!) i like this.', '2002-04-16 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47577, 840, 446, '<td valign="top">Seems like me some time, just blowing in the wind :&amp;gt;)  Tough shot to isolate the background.  As hopefully constructive criticism, you might have tried a longer focal length for this shot to get a narrower viewing angle, and shooting from a higher position.  This technique would have yielded more of the grass and less of the trees as a background.  Just something to think about for the next challenge.  Use all of your tools.  The exposure is great.  Great concept.  Well focused and sharp.  Composition is all this photo needs.  Good job.</td>', 'Seems like me some time, just blowing in the wind :&gt;)  Tough shot to isolate the background.  As hopefully constructive criticism, you might have tried a longer focal length for this shot to get a narrower viewing angle, and shooting from a higher position.  This technique would have yielded more of the grass and less of the trees as a background.  Just something to think about for the next challenge.  Use all of your tools.  The exposure is great.  Great concept.  Well focused and sharp.  Composition is all this photo needs.  Good job.', '2002-04-16 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47578, 840, 205, '<td valign="top">You''re funny</td>', 'You''re funny', '2002-04-16 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47579, 840, 332, '<td valign="top">Good work.</td>', 'Good work.', '2002-04-16 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47580, 840, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent title colors and sharpness.  gets a high score.</td>', 'excellent title colors and sharpness.  gets a high score.', '2002-04-17 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47581, 840, 749, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and perfect title!</td>', 'Great idea, and perfect title!', '2002-04-17 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47582, 840, 142, '<td valign="top">I like the title and this is a very nice photo.</td>', 'I like the title and this is a very nice photo.', '2002-04-17 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47583, 840, 587, '<td valign="top">Great clarity. I find the background somewhat distracting though, still one of my faves!</td>', 'Great clarity. I find the background somewhat distracting though, still one of my faves!', '2002-04-17 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47584, 840, 1061, '<td valign="top">I like!</td>', 'I like!', '2002-04-18 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47585, 840, 543, '<td valign="top">"...caution <i>to</i>the wind", actually.  {g}  Good eye on you.  Could be cropped down and right just a little to lose some of that hot white sky.</td>', '"...caution tothe wind", actually.  {g}  Good eye on you.  Could be cropped down and right just a little to lose some of that hot white sky.', '2002-04-18 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47586, 840, 245, '<td valign="top">i really like the dirt on the tape, but wish I could se more of the post on the left.</td>', 'i really like the dirt on the tape, but wish I could se more of the post on the left.', '2002-04-18 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47587, 840, 1164, '<td valign="top">Really really nice picture.</td>', 'Really really nice picture.', '2002-04-18 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47588, 840, 1141, '<td valign="top">Background is blurry and a little distracting</td>', 'Background is blurry and a little distracting', '2002-04-18 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47589, 840, 811, '<td valign="top">Eye-catching, neat idea.</td>', 'Eye-catching, neat idea.', '2002-04-18 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47590, 840, 2, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and original choice for action shot.  I really like the detail on the fence... though I know I''m not supposed be focusing on that :)</td>', 'Nice colors, and original choice for action shot.  I really like the detail on the fence... though I know I''m not supposed be focusing on that :)', '2002-04-18 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47591, 840, 797, '<td valign="top">creative choice of subject. i like the way you waited for the strip to align with the grass line. good focus and colors</td>', 'creative choice of subject. i like the way you waited for the strip to align with the grass line. good focus and colors', '2002-04-19 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47592, 840, 862, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-04-19 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47593, 840, 361, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I can''t see anything that I would change.</td>', 'Good photo. I can''t see anything that I would change.', '2002-04-19 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47594, 840, 1175, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  It doesn''t imply enough motion though.</td>', 'Nice title.  It doesn''t imply enough motion though.', '2002-04-19 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47595, 840, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Too bad the caution sign is so tore up and dirty.</td>', 'Nice photo. Too bad the caution sign is so tore up and dirty.', '2002-04-20 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47596, 840, 1202, '<td valign="top">I suppose the wind was really blowing that cation tape around, but its not in the picture.   What is in the picture that tells the rest of the story?</td>', 'I suppose the wind was really blowing that cation tape around, but its not in the picture.   What is in the picture that tells the rest of the story?', '2002-04-20 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47597, 840, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The title might be great if you phrased it right: "Throw Caution TO the Wind".  A tighter crop of the caution ribbon, cuttong of the grass on the right might''ve worked out better.</td>', 'Great shot.  The title might be great if you phrased it right: "Throw Caution TO the Wind".  A tighter crop of the caution ribbon, cuttong of the grass on the right might''ve worked out better.', '2002-04-21 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47598, 840, 806, '<td valign="top">nice title. different subject!</td>', 'nice title. different subject!', '2002-04-21 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47599, 841, 107, '<td valign="top">Thats a georgous picture.  very well done, and I like the layout.  beautiful.</td>', 'Thats a georgous picture.  very well done, and I like the layout.  beautiful.', '2002-04-15 04:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47600, 841, 92, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this. The crisp, clean, action of it is great and the thirds rule is perfect. You caught the ripples and the drop in action.Great job :)</td>', 'I REALLY like this. The crisp, clean, action of it is great and the thirds rule is perfect. You caught the ripples and the drop in action.Great job :)', '2002-04-15 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47601, 841, 1024, '<td valign="top">Of all of the water pictures, this one was my favorite by far.  I love the "texture" of the water.</td>', 'Of all of the water pictures, this one was my favorite by far.  I love the "texture" of the water.', '2002-04-15 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47602, 841, 641, '<td valign="top">Oh my you caught that really well. Looks almost like ice.</td>', 'Oh my you caught that really well. Looks almost like ice.', '2002-04-15 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47603, 841, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, it looks digital, I''d be interested to hear how you took this</td>', 'This is a nice shot, it looks digital, I''d be interested to hear how you took this', '2002-04-15 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47604, 841, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Almost looks frozen.  Great light/ highlights too.  Like the off-center framing - tell us how you caught it  ?</td>', 'Lovely.  Almost looks frozen.  Great light/ highlights too.  Like the off-center framing - tell us how you caught it  ?', '2002-04-15 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47605, 841, 772, '<td valign="top">Ummmm... I have been commenting these votes with, yep, nope, nope, yep, yep, nope, nope, nope, yep, yep, HOLY LIQUID EXPLOSIONS BATMAN!  You''ve been bad.. you get NO criticism on this one... I think we have a winner!!!  Maybe one day I will be this good.  May I be your Jedi In Training?  The force is with you Luke... I can feel it...</td>', 'Ummmm... I have been commenting these votes with, yep, nope, nope, yep, yep, nope, nope, nope, yep, yep, HOLY LIQUID EXPLOSIONS BATMAN!  You''ve been bad.. you get NO criticism on this one... I think we have a winner!!!  Maybe one day I will be this good.  May I be your Jedi In Training?  The force is with you Luke... I can feel it...', '2002-04-15 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47606, 841, 640, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to do this. Good work!</td>', 'I know how hard it is to do this. Good work!', '2002-04-15 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47607, 841, 301, '<td valign="top">I love this water shot ... looks like T2 gathering himself back together!</td>', 'I love this water shot ... looks like T2 gathering himself back together!', '2002-04-15 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47608, 841, 189, '<td valign="top">I Like the color</td>', 'I Like the color', '2002-04-15 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47609, 841, 734, '<td valign="top">I really like this image</td>', 'I really like this image', '2002-04-15 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47610, 841, 139, '<td valign="top">Well executed!</td>', 'Well executed!', '2002-04-15 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47611, 841, 279, '<td valign="top">Visually striking image. A lot of water shots were inevitable, and this isn''t just the best of those it''s a fantastic shot overall.</td>', 'Visually striking image. A lot of water shots were inevitable, and this isn''t just the best of those it''s a fantastic shot overall.', '2002-04-15 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
