(47616, 841, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!! Nothing is wrong with this photo.  You met the challenge well!  :)</td>', 'Very nice!!!! Nothing is wrong with this photo.  You met the challenge well!  :)', '2002-04-15 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47617, 841, 675, '<td valign="top">looks totally fake, but since it isn''t disqualified, you get a 10</td>', 'looks totally fake, but since it isn''t disqualified, you get a 10', '2002-04-15 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47618, 841, 554, '<td valign="top">A Ten Here. Almost doesn''t look like water.</td>', 'A Ten Here. Almost doesn''t look like water.', '2002-04-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47619, 841, 782, '<td valign="top">Good and sharp nicely done</td>', 'Good and sharp nicely done', '2002-04-15 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47620, 841, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2002-04-15 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47621, 841, 1085, '<td valign="top">not too creative, but i have this thing for water.... DOWN  BOY, DOWN!!! besides, the focus and all is really well done.... i like it, i like it a lot !</td>', 'not too creative, but i have this thing for water.... DOWN  BOY, DOWN!!! besides, the focus and all is really well done.... i like it, i like it a lot !', '2002-04-15 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47622, 841, 446, '<td valign="top">Though some have called the water shots boring, I think you did a great job here.  Your composition and exposure are excellent in my opinion.  Would have been even better if you could have avoided the few extra bubbles, forcing the viewers eye to stay on the main oblect in the scene.  The photo evokes an image of blown glass.  Nice work.</td>', 'Though some have called the water shots boring, I think you did a great job here.  Your composition and exposure are excellent in my opinion.  Would have been even better if you could have avoided the few extra bubbles, forcing the viewers eye to stay on the main oblect in the scene.  The photo evokes an image of blown glass.  Nice work.', '2002-04-15 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47623, 841, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot here.  Technically superb.  The best water shot I''ve seen thus far.</td>', 'Great shot here.  Technically superb.  The best water shot I''ve seen thus far.', '2002-04-15 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47624, 841, 797, '<td valign="top">Timed perfectly for the rebound upthrust! I love the way light is reflected off the water. Your off-center lower left quadrant emphasis is also very nice.</td>', 'Timed perfectly for the rebound upthrust! I love the way light is reflected off the water. Your off-center lower left quadrant emphasis is also very nice.', '2002-04-16 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47625, 841, 813, '<td valign="top">Terrific. Love the tones. focus, composition, etc. Very nice job.</td>', 'Terrific. Love the tones. focus, composition, etc. Very nice job.', '2002-04-16 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47626, 841, 1078, '<td valign="top">Perhaps "everybody" decided to use liquid, but this is the best of the lot -- frozen and focused sharp as crystal</td>', 'Perhaps "everybody" decided to use liquid, but this is the best of the lot -- frozen and focused sharp as crystal', '2002-04-16 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47627, 841, 2, '<td valign="top">This looks almost 3D-rendered the detail is so sharp.  Wow.</td>', 'This looks almost 3D-rendered the detail is so sharp.  Wow.', '2002-04-16 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47628, 841, 255, '<td valign="top">very cool, very peaceful!</td>', 'very cool, very peaceful!', '2002-04-16 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47629, 841, 205, '<td valign="top">Best water submission so far, nice how you used the rule of thirds, so many people put the subject in the center.</td>', 'Best water submission so far, nice how you used the rule of thirds, so many people put the subject in the center.', '2002-04-16 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47630, 841, 145, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I like the framing of the shot and the concetric ripples in the water.</td>', 'Great shot! I like the framing of the shot and the concetric ripples in the water.', '2002-04-16 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47631, 841, 441, '<td valign="top">technically superb, georgeous without much colour</td>', 'technically superb, georgeous without much colour', '2002-04-17 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47632, 841, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent texture on that water!  i wonder what the scale is here?</td>', 'excellent texture on that water!  i wonder what the scale is here?', '2002-04-17 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47633, 841, 811, '<td valign="top">Good timing and capture.</td>', 'Good timing and capture.', '2002-04-17 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47634, 841, 1132, '<td valign="top">Wow. Although this is not necessarily an original concept, it is well executed, well composed, and sharp.</td>', 'Wow. Although this is not necessarily an original concept, it is well executed, well composed, and sharp.', '2002-04-17 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47635, 841, 749, '<td valign="top">Beautiful timing and lighting, feels almost like it was raytraced :o)</td>', 'Beautiful timing and lighting, feels almost like it was raytraced :o)', '2002-04-17 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47636, 841, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, very crisp image.  Once of the best water shots.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Very nice composition, very crisp image.  Once of the best water shots.  Nice photo!', '2002-04-17 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
