(47655, 841, 715, '<td valign="top">Thanks, I was getting kind of annoyed by the complaints about "to many watershots" in the forums. It was the first time I ever made a picture of this subject, and didn''t even think about it how often it was done before. I just wanted to make a good picture.<br/><br/>Also thanks to everbody forgiving such high votes and for the great comments. It was my second submission to any challenge ever and I never expected this.<br/><br/>Beause I was asked several times how the picture was made, I made a web-page with a full description. If you are interested, [a target="_blank" href="//digicam.weba000.com/dpc_stopmotion.html"]click here[/a] to go there (BTW: English is not my first language, so please don''t mind the languistic errors on he page).<br/></td>', 'Thanks, I was getting kind of annoyed by the complaints about "to many watershots" in the forums. It was the first time I ever made a picture of this subject, and didn''t even think about it how often it was done before. I just wanted to make a good picture.Also thanks to everbody forgiving such high votes and for the great comments. It was my second submission to any challenge ever and I never expected this.Beause I was asked several times how the picture was made, I made a web-page with a full description. If you are interested, [a target="_blank" href="//digicam.weba000.com/dpc_stopmotion.html"]click here[/a] to go there (BTW: English is not my first language, so please don''t mind the languistic errors on he page).', '2002-04-22 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
