(47790, 845, 798, '<td valign="top">After breaking my dad''s entire supply I changed my vote on this from 6 to 8. Good job! How''d u do that?!</td>', 'After breaking my dad''s entire supply I changed my vote on this from 6 to 8. Good job! How''d u do that?!', '2002-04-17 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
