(47825, 846, 92, '<td valign="top">Oh my ! What a great capture ! There are a lot of water pics this time but this is VERY well done ! The framing is great as well as the choice of subject. Great job.</td>', 'Oh my ! What a great capture ! There are a lot of water pics this time but this is VERY well done ! The framing is great as well as the choice of subject. Great job.', '2002-04-15 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
