(47854, 847, 813, '<td valign="top">the prettiest water shot so far. I don''t even care that most of it''s out of focus. it makes an interesting background.</td>', 'the prettiest water shot so far. I don''t even care that most of it''s out of focus. it makes an interesting background.', '2002-04-15 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
