(47862, 847, 301, '<td valign="top">flash reflections on droplets don''t help this shot at all.  Would be better if you zoomed in closer and concentrated on a small number of droplets, as there is no real point of interest in this shot.</td>', 'flash reflections on droplets don''t help this shot at all.  Would be better if you zoomed in closer and concentrated on a small number of droplets, as there is no real point of interest in this shot.', '2002-04-17 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47863, 847, 811, '<td valign="top">Good sharp images on the right, and I like the background color (the contrast it makes with the water).  The blurry drops in the front, though, caught my eye first, and it took me a second or two to "see through" them.  If I was more accomplished at photography, maybe I could offer suggestions on how to fix it.  Sorry.</td>', 'Good sharp images on the right, and I like the background color (the contrast it makes with the water).  The blurry drops in the front, though, caught my eye first, and it took me a second or two to "see through" them.  If I was more accomplished at photography, maybe I could offer suggestions on how to fix it.  Sorry.', '2002-04-17 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
