(47916, 848, 1240, '<td valign="top">Obviously an Icelandic influence there!</td>', 'Obviously an Icelandic influence there!', '2002-04-21 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47917, 848, 142, '<td valign="top">I think you would have placed higher if more people understood the subject.  I did and I definately appreciate how well you stopped the action.  Those machines run very fast.  If you are ever in my area I''ll bet my company would love some photos like this for our brochure and webpage.</td>', 'I think you would have placed higher if more people understood the subject.  I did and I definately appreciate how well you stopped the action.  Those machines run very fast.  If you are ever in my area I''ll bet my company would love some photos like this for our brochure and webpage.', '2002-04-22 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(47918, 848, 772, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and your votes on this photo.  This is an Okuma Vertical Drill.  I only had one person comment that the drill may not be moving so I''m happy with that.  The drill was rotating at 450 rpms and if you look, you can see that coolant is swirling and slinging from the drill.  I never expected to finish this high because of all the ''subjective'' whining in the forums....  Thanks!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and your votes on this photo.  This is an Okuma Vertical Drill.  I only had one person comment that the drill may not be moving so I''m happy with that.  The drill was rotating at 450 rpms and if you look, you can see that coolant is swirling and slinging from the drill.  I never expected to finish this high because of all the ''subjective'' whining in the forums....  Thanks!', '2002-04-22 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(47919, 848, 933, '<td valign="top">Hey John, I''m surprised this did not finish in the top 10.  Very good shot!  Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Hey John, I''m surprised this did not finish in the top 10.  Very good shot!  Keep up the great work.', '2002-04-22 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
