(47930, 851, 1, '<td valign="top">I realize it''s your shower and you can''t change it, but the background isn''t very fitting for a shot like this.  Although they are some nicely caugh drops.</td>', 'I realize it''s your shower and you can''t change it, but the background isn''t very fitting for a shot like this.  Although they are some nicely caugh drops.', '2002-04-15 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47931, 851, 245, '<td valign="top">The walls could be more vertical, it feels tipped to the left. It looks a little oversharpened to me, too.</td>', 'The walls could be more vertical, it feels tipped to the left. It looks a little oversharpened to me, too.', '2002-04-16 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47932, 851, 301, '<td valign="top">good effort stopping the motion here.  droplets are clear and well focussed.  Unfortunately, this isn''t the best of backgrounds and the flash has cast shadows on the tiles</td>', 'good effort stopping the motion here.  droplets are clear and well focussed.  Unfortunately, this isn''t the best of backgrounds and the flash has cast shadows on the tiles', '2002-04-16 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47933, 851, 813, '<td valign="top">like the action, too bad the background ruins it</td>', 'like the action, too bad the background ruins it', '2002-04-16 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47934, 851, 1078, '<td valign="top">I don''t think those drips could have been suspended any more perfectly, although I do, personally, find the tile pattern and color in the background a little distracting</td>', 'I don''t think those drips could have been suspended any more perfectly, although I do, personally, find the tile pattern and color in the background a little distracting', '2002-04-16 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47935, 851, 361, '<td valign="top">Glad my shower doesn''t drip like that! Good shot!</td>', 'Glad my shower doesn''t drip like that! Good shot!', '2002-04-16 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47936, 851, 472, '<td valign="top">this funny. neaeto.</td>', 'this funny. neaeto.', '2002-04-17 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47937, 851, 1132, '<td valign="top">I wish the perpendicular lines were actually parallel to the edge of the image. Just a little bit of rotation might fix this.</td>', 'I wish the perpendicular lines were actually parallel to the edge of the image. Just a little bit of rotation might fix this.', '2002-04-17 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47938, 851, 205, '<td valign="top">Something about this isn''t doing it for me maybe closer up with no flash?</td>', 'Something about this isn''t doing it for me maybe closer up with no flash?', '2002-04-18 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47939, 851, 587, '<td valign="top">I am being forced to look at the corner instead of the water, wish this was angled differently. good clarity in the water.</td>', 'I am being forced to look at the corner instead of the water, wish this was angled differently. good clarity in the water.', '2002-04-18 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47940, 851, 671, '<td valign="top">really nice stop action.  Great focus.</td>', 'really nice stop action.  Great focus.', '2002-04-18 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47941, 851, 142, '<td valign="top">The water droplets look great.  The shadow is slightly distracting but it is still a good photo.</td>', 'The water droplets look great.  The shadow is slightly distracting but it is still a good photo.', '2002-04-18 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47942, 851, 933, '<td valign="top">NO, wait, that''s MY shower!</td>', 'NO, wait, that''s MY shower!', '2002-04-18 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47943, 851, 739, '<td valign="top">Nice even droplets.  I love how they are evenly lit and outlined.  Reminds me of jello.</td>', 'Nice even droplets.  I love how they are evenly lit and outlined.  Reminds me of jello.', '2002-04-19 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47944, 851, 797, '<td valign="top">not really very interesting.</td>', 'not really very interesting.', '2002-04-19 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47945, 851, 811, '<td valign="top">Well-defined water drops, they are very clear.</td>', 'Well-defined water drops, they are very clear.', '2002-04-19 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47946, 851, 1175, '<td valign="top">overdone</td>', 'overdone', '2002-04-19 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47947, 851, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Your droplets are very clear.  Maybe honing in on one or two would have cleaned the photo up.</td>', 'Nice job.  Your droplets are very clear.  Maybe honing in on one or two would have cleaned the photo up.', '2002-04-20 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47948, 851, 1209, '<td valign="top">Verysharp image, and the shadowa of the drops are thought provoking, too.Good work!</td>', 'Verysharp image, and the shadowa of the drops are thought provoking, too.Good work!', '2002-04-21 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47949, 851, 790, '<td valign="top">drops look sharp, too simple</td>', 'drops look sharp, too simple', '2002-04-21 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47950, 852, 656, '<td valign="top">good idea.  Colours don''t really seem to come up strongly enough though.</td>', 'good idea.  Colours don''t really seem to come up strongly enough though.', '2002-04-15 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47951, 852, 772, '<td valign="top">I photographed one of these one time and got similar results.  This is a cool photo but I''m not rating it higly on ''stopped motion''.</td>', 'I photographed one of these one time and got similar results.  This is a cool photo but I''m not rating it higly on ''stopped motion''.', '2002-04-15 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47952, 852, 641, '<td valign="top">Nice color and stop motion. Very tight shot too. I like this.</td>', 'Nice color and stop motion. Very tight shot too. I like this.', '2002-04-15 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47953, 852, 92, '<td valign="top">Nice work:) Just a little bit of blur:)</td>', 'Nice work:) Just a little bit of blur:)', '2002-04-15 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47954, 852, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2002-04-15 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47955, 852, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2002-04-15 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47956, 852, 1, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed that you got them to stay still.  :)  Perhaps a better centering job would''ve worked better.</td>', 'I''m impressed that you got them to stay still.  :)  Perhaps a better centering job would''ve worked better.', '2002-04-15 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47957, 852, 2, '<td valign="top">Centering would have made this image more powerful.</td>', 'Centering would have made this image more powerful.', '2002-04-16 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47958, 852, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think the overall picture is too dark.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think the overall picture is too dark.', '2002-04-16 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47959, 852, 813, '<td valign="top">more exposure please, this looks like it could be interestiong, but it''s so dark</td>', 'more exposure please, this looks like it could be interestiong, but it''s so dark', '2002-04-16 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47960, 852, 509, '<td valign="top">Cool subject.  Its a bit dark, but a slow shutter speed would''ve blurred the lights probably.  The little yellow light in the bottom center doesn''t fit though, is that from the auto focus assist light on your camera?</td>', 'Cool subject.  Its a bit dark, but a slow shutter speed would''ve blurred the lights probably.  The little yellow light in the bottom center doesn''t fit though, is that from the auto focus assist light on your camera?', '2002-04-16 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47961, 852, 441, '<td valign="top">interesting and original shot much better than the rising bubble pics!</td>', 'interesting and original shot much better than the rising bubble pics!', '2002-04-17 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47962, 852, 749, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but its a bit too dark. Maybe having someone touching it on the sides would have helped balance the plasma trails.</td>', 'Good idea, but its a bit too dark. Maybe having someone touching it on the sides would have helped balance the plasma trails.', '2002-04-17 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47963, 852, 472, '<td valign="top">i like these things.  did you try juicing up the levels some?</td>', 'i like these things.  did you try juicing up the levels some?', '2002-04-17 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47964, 852, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo.  It would seem that it would be hard to capture the lights on one of these lamps without getting the light trail.  You did a very good job.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo.  It would seem that it would be hard to capture the lights on one of these lamps without getting the light trail.  You did a very good job.', '2002-04-17 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47965, 852, 933, '<td valign="top">Way too dark.</td>', 'Way too dark.', '2002-04-17 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47966, 852, 205, '<td valign="top">Too Dark</td>', 'Too Dark', '2002-04-18 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47967, 852, 797, '<td valign="top">ahh.. a plasma ball. haven''t seen that in some time. must''ve been difficult to get it in stop action with enough light. kudos for hard work.</td>', 'ahh.. a plasma ball. haven''t seen that in some time. must''ve been difficult to get it in stop action with enough light. kudos for hard work.', '2002-04-19 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47968, 852, 301, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a slight outline of the globe</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a slight outline of the globe', '2002-04-19 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47969, 852, 811, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, great colors, a bit too dark, and some blurring.</td>', 'Neat idea, great colors, a bit too dark, and some blurring.', '2002-04-19 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47970, 852, 1175, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the subject for this topic.</td>', 'I don''t like the subject for this topic.', '2002-04-19 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47971, 852, 113, '<td valign="top">More!  I want to see more color and more waves.</td>', 'More!  I want to see more color and more waves.', '2002-04-20 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47972, 852, 1202, '<td valign="top">I guess its static electricity.   Interesting picture despite poor lighting, however it doesn''t immediately give me a feeling of stopped motion as many others do.</td>', 'I guess its static electricity.   Interesting picture despite poor lighting, however it doesn''t immediately give me a feeling of stopped motion as many others do.', '2002-04-20 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(47973, 852, 1195, '<td valign="top">Awsome Technique!!! Great Job</td>', 'Awsome Technique!!! Great Job', '2002-04-21 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47974, 852, 245, '<td valign="top">did you try pumping the brightest areas with the levels control in photoshop to bring out more detail?</td>', 'did you try pumping the brightest areas with the levels control in photoshop to bring out more detail?', '2002-04-22 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47975, 857, 352, '<td valign="top">You may have caught an excellent shot, but as I see no indication of motion here, I have to rate 1 for lack of fit to challenge.</td>', 'You may have caught an excellent shot, but as I see no indication of motion here, I have to rate 1 for lack of fit to challenge.', '2002-04-15 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47976, 857, 1055, '<td valign="top">is it really spinning or just on its side?</td>', 'is it really spinning or just on its side?', '2002-04-15 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47977, 857, 656, '<td valign="top">either spinning or you''ve got good balance.  Hard to tell if it was really in motion or not.  Good maro focus.</td>', 'either spinning or you''ve got good balance.  Hard to tell if it was really in motion or not.  Good maro focus.', '2002-04-15 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47978, 857, 1024, '<td valign="top">Its hard to say if this was really spinning or not.</td>', 'Its hard to say if this was really spinning or not.', '2002-04-15 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47979, 857, 714, '<td valign="top">You captured the object well.</td>', 'You captured the object well.', '2002-04-15 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47980, 857, 641, '<td valign="top">good capture, the speckled background is a bit much though.</td>', 'good capture, the speckled background is a bit much though.', '2002-04-15 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47981, 857, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph of a spinning quarter.  I can tell that it is spinning due to a little blur that is present in the photo.  This photo could possibly be mis-interpreted as a stationary quarter because of the perspective.  I tried some shots like this with poker chips.  I found that getting down low with the camera and photographing the spin during the later stage when the chip was settling towards the table made a more dramatic shot.</td>', 'This is a nice photograph of a spinning quarter.  I can tell that it is spinning due to a little blur that is present in the photo.  This photo could possibly be mis-interpreted as a stationary quarter because of the perspective.  I tried some shots like this with poker chips.  I found that getting down low with the camera and photographing the spin during the later stage when the chip was settling towards the table made a more dramatic shot.', '2002-04-15 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47982, 857, 509, '<td valign="top">Very good detail, nice macro shot</td>', 'Very good detail, nice macro shot', '2002-04-15 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47983, 857, 203, '<td valign="top">Impossible to tell if it is falling or resting on edge.  More of a mirrired surface would accent the slight gap.</td>', 'Impossible to tell if it is falling or resting on edge.  More of a mirrired surface would accent the slight gap.', '2002-04-15 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47984, 857, 92, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see what type of camera took this ! Nice clean and clear !</td>', 'I can''t wait to see what type of camera took this ! Nice clean and clear !', '2002-04-15 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47985, 857, 813, '<td valign="top">Sharp.</td>', 'Sharp.', '2002-04-15 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47986, 857, 661, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2002-04-15 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47987, 857, 139, '<td valign="top">Good job!  I tried this, and failed to get something I liked.   It would be better if it was closer to finishing, but I know from experience that it isn''t that easy. :)   Overall, I like it.</td>', 'Good job!  I tried this, and failed to get something I liked.   It would be better if it was closer to finishing, but I know from experience that it isn''t that easy. :)   Overall, I like it.', '2002-04-15 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47988, 857, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with the coin (I''m trying it myself now), but I think it would have been a more interesting picture, if the coin was at the end of spinning and in the process of falling over. That way it would give a better impression that the coin is in motion.<br/></td>', 'I like the idea with the coin (I''m trying it myself now), but I think it would have been a more interesting picture, if the coin was at the end of spinning and in the process of falling over. That way it would give a better impression that the coin is in motion.', '2002-04-16 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47989, 857, 2, '<td valign="top">Centering this image would have made it better.</td>', 'Centering this image would have made it better.', '2002-04-16 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47990, 857, 445, '<td valign="top">Except for title can''t tell if it is balanced or spinning.</td>', 'Except for title can''t tell if it is balanced or spinning.', '2002-04-16 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47991, 857, 910, '<td valign="top">cool picture, but it''s hard to tell if the quarter is really spinning.  I''m sure that it is, but...</td>', 'cool picture, but it''s hard to tell if the quarter is really spinning.  I''m sure that it is, but...', '2002-04-16 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47992, 857, 441, '<td valign="top">original shot well stopped</td>', 'original shot well stopped', '2002-04-17 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47993, 857, 862, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How many takes did that require?</td>', 'Wow!  How many takes did that require?', '2002-04-17 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47994, 857, 301, '<td valign="top">if it is spinning then well done ... but I''m not so sure</td>', 'if it is spinning then well done ... but I''m not so sure', '2002-04-17 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47995, 857, 472, '<td valign="top">original subject matter.  i almost think this would have been better with some motion trails, tho but you did fulfill the challenge :)</td>', 'original subject matter.  i almost think this would have been better with some motion trails, tho but you did fulfill the challenge :)', '2002-04-17 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47996, 857, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It either needs to be centered exactly, or more off-center.  The light reflections are a little blurry, but that convinced me that the quarter was actually spinning.</td>', 'Nice shot.  It either needs to be centered exactly, or more off-center.  The light reflections are a little blurry, but that convinced me that the quarter was actually spinning.', '2002-04-17 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47997, 857, 749, '<td valign="top">The tabletop is a bit too distracting, but the lighting is good</td>', 'The tabletop is a bit too distracting, but the lighting is good', '2002-04-17 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47998, 857, 361, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a good one! Can''t think of anything I''d change.</td>', 'Wow! This is a good one! Can''t think of anything I''d change.', '2002-04-17 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(47999, 857, 587, '<td valign="top">great shot.</td>', 'great shot.', '2002-04-17 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48000, 857, 1061, '<td valign="top">could be just standing on its edge</td>', 'could be just standing on its edge', '2002-04-18 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48001, 857, 330, '<td valign="top">Good close up shot but this picture could be read as a still shot of a quarter balanced on edge. Nice trry.</td>', 'Good close up shot but this picture could be read as a still shot of a quarter balanced on edge. Nice trry.', '2002-04-18 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48002, 857, 933, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of stop motion.  Very well executed.  The photo just doesn''t reach out and grab me, though.</td>', 'This is a good example of stop motion.  Very well executed.  The photo just doesn''t reach out and grab me, though.', '2002-04-18 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48003, 857, 205, '<td valign="top">I can place a picture on a table and call it spinning too but that dosen''t mean it actually was. I like the composition and all its just not a good example of a stop motion picture</td>', 'I can place a picture on a table and call it spinning too but that dosen''t mean it actually was. I like the composition and all its just not a good example of a stop motion picture', '2002-04-18 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48004, 857, 245, '<td valign="top">aren''t shots like this next to impossible to frame?</td>', 'aren''t shots like this next to impossible to frame?', '2002-04-19 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48005, 857, 797, '<td valign="top">nice spin. was it difficult to catch it in the right angle?</td>', 'nice spin. was it difficult to catch it in the right angle?', '2002-04-19 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48006, 857, 1175, '<td valign="top">Kind of bland.  Need more excitement.  Something that implies more motion.</td>', 'Kind of bland.  Need more excitement.  Something that implies more motion.', '2002-04-19 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48007, 857, 543, '<td valign="top">Okay... how many tries?  I think this is one that would work a little better with some more blur to indicate motion (not for this challenge, but just to make the best image).  Trouble is, I have this habit of standing coins up on end...</td>', 'Okay... how many tries?  I think this is one that would work a little better with some more blur to indicate motion (not for this challenge, but just to make the best image).  Trouble is, I have this habit of standing coins up on end...', '2002-04-19 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48008, 857, 113, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm, is it really??</td>', 'hmmmmmm, is it really??', '2002-04-20 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48009, 857, 637, '<td valign="top">How do we know that its moving and not just standing on end?</td>', 'How do we know that its moving and not just standing on end?', '2002-04-20 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48010, 857, 1209, '<td valign="top">There is nothing to indicate this object was moving in the first place. A necessary factor to prove there is "stop action" involved!</td>', 'There is nothing to indicate this object was moving in the first place. A necessary factor to prove there is "stop action" involved!', '2002-04-20 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48011, 857, 346, '<td valign="top">the composition doesn''t hold me for long.</td>', 'the composition doesn''t hold me for long.', '2002-04-20 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48012, 857, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I''m not sensing any movement - except for the title... therefore I have to grade it low.</td>', 'Nice picture but I''m not sensing any movement - except for the title... therefore I have to grade it low.', '2002-04-21 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48013, 857, 1, '<td valign="top">I can imagine this was very hard to do.  A few more tries would''ve gotten the quarter at a better angle and not so much head on.</td>', 'I can imagine this was very hard to do.  A few more tries would''ve gotten the quarter at a better angle and not so much head on.', '2002-04-21 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48014, 857, 1135, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, Nice.</td>', 'Great DOF, Nice.', '2002-04-21 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48015, 857, 142, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you who did not doubt my entry.  I had some very complimentary and helpful comments and I appreciate every one.  To everyone else I hope you can take me at my word, I am not the type of person to ever do anything dishonest.</td>', 'Thanks to all of you who did not doubt my entry.  I had some very complimentary and helpful comments and I appreciate every one.  To everyone else I hope you can take me at my word, I am not the type of person to ever do anything dishonest.', '2002-04-22 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(48016, 858, 2, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This picture is just outstanding.  Since we''re all hunting for flaws, I''m sure you''ll get comments about the fence post.  But congrats on such a great shot.</td>', 'Wow.  This picture is just outstanding.  Since we''re all hunting for flaws, I''m sure you''ll get comments about the fence post.  But congrats on such a great shot.', '2002-04-15 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48017, 858, 674, '<td valign="top">Lovely facial expressions motion stopped beautifully</td>', 'Lovely facial expressions motion stopped beautifully', '2002-04-15 05:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48018, 858, 92, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot ! I think a shot of the girl in the air alone with that beautiful sky and no fence would have been a 10 !</td>', 'Awesome shot ! I think a shot of the girl in the air alone with that beautiful sky and no fence would have been a 10 !', '2002-04-15 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48019, 858, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice picture,  very happy girls.</td>', 'Nice picture,  very happy girls.', '2002-04-15 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48020, 858, 813, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Meets the criteria perfectly, but more importantly it is well composed, good color, sharp focus and full of spirit. A real Eye grabber. Did you consider cropping it vertically to take out fence post?</td>', 'Excellent. Meets the criteria perfectly, but more importantly it is well composed, good color, sharp focus and full of spirit. A real Eye grabber. Did you consider cropping it vertically to take out fence post?', '2002-04-15 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48021, 858, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The hair on the girl in the front of the image is great!  The color and contrast on this photo is exceptoinal.  The only improvements I could offer for this photo are that the girl with the ''coolest'' hair is just a tad out of focus, and I''m not sure what your framing options were.  The ''airborne'' girl looks great but I would like to see more of the girl at the bottom of the picture.  Including more of her may have also included more of the wooden fence I see in the lower left.  Changing the cropping a little may have helped take care of this.  Very nice work!</td>', 'I love this photo.  The hair on the girl in the front of the image is great!  The color and contrast on this photo is exceptoinal.  The only improvements I could offer for this photo are that the girl with the ''coolest'' hair is just a tad out of focus, and I''m not sure what your framing options were.  The ''airborne'' girl looks great but I would like to see more of the girl at the bottom of the picture.  Including more of her may have also included more of the wooden fence I see in the lower left.  Changing the cropping a little may have helped take care of this.  Very nice work!', '2002-04-15 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48022, 858, 509, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, but would have been better without the distraction in the lower left corner</td>', 'Good action shot, but would have been better without the distraction in the lower left corner', '2002-04-15 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48023, 858, 1058, '<td valign="top">The reason I like this picture is the colors, you use opposite colors and the photgraphic structure is also good.</td>', 'The reason I like this picture is the colors, you use opposite colors and the photgraphic structure is also good.', '2002-04-15 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
