(48040, 858, 715, '<td valign="top">This photo has got it! I think it''s perfect, except for the part of the trampolne in the left-bottom corner. But I guess you didn''t cut it cut out because that would  destroy the whole compostion. <br/></td>', 'This photo has got it! I think it''s perfect, except for the part of the trampolne in the left-bottom corner. But I guess you didn''t cut it cut out because that would  destroy the whole compostion. ', '2002-04-16 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
