(48115, 859, 724, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who commented on this photo. It was my second photo contributed to the site and I am very happy with the voting results.  I was limited shooting this photo considering the kids (mine) didn''t want to spend the day watching me take photos, and they wern''t going to ride this one for all of the PEZ dispensers in the world!!  Thanks again for your comments, I love dpchallenge!!!</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who commented on this photo. It was my second photo contributed to the site and I am very happy with the voting results.  I was limited shooting this photo considering the kids (mine) didn''t want to spend the day watching me take photos, and they wern''t going to ride this one for all of the PEZ dispensers in the world!!  Thanks again for your comments, I love dpchallenge!!!', '2002-04-22 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(48116, 861, 107, '<td valign="top">Thats a cool picture.  very nice, and the colours contrast and stick out very dramaticly.  job well done.</td>', 'Thats a cool picture.  very nice, and the colours contrast and stick out very dramaticly.  job well done.', '2002-04-15 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48117, 861, 1055, '<td valign="top">i like the magic gloves.  _this_ is excellent!  ^_^</td>', 'i like the magic gloves.  _this_ is excellent!  ^_^', '2002-04-15 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48118, 861, 772, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a nice photo!  The gloves made this work rather well.  I tried some card shuffling in my own efforts at stopped motion.  The hands would be better if they were centered in this shot.  It would possibly be nicer as well if there were some more empty space (not nuch) underneath the hands.  Nice Work!</td>', 'Congratulations on a nice photo!  The gloves made this work rather well.  I tried some card shuffling in my own efforts at stopped motion.  The hands would be better if they were centered in this shot.  It would possibly be nicer as well if there were some more empty space (not nuch) underneath the hands.  Nice Work!', '2002-04-15 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48119, 861, 656, '<td valign="top">nice idea and well done.  Would have been better to have the cards more separated, but I know how hard this is to get even one right :)</td>', 'nice idea and well done.  Would have been better to have the cards more separated, but I know how hard this is to get even one right :)', '2002-04-15 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48120, 861, 301, '<td valign="top">would have liked to have seen the shot centered and the cards separated more ... that''s me nitpicking though.  Good idea and well executed</td>', 'would have liked to have seen the shot centered and the cards separated more ... that''s me nitpicking though.  Good idea and well executed', '2002-04-15 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48121, 861, 641, '<td valign="top">I love it.. the gloves really make it. Very crisp clear shot too.</td>', 'I love it.. the gloves really make it. Very crisp clear shot too.', '2002-04-15 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48122, 861, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2002-04-15 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48123, 861, 714, '<td valign="top">your camera did a great job at stopping the objects.  good job.</td>', 'your camera did a great job at stopping the objects.  good job.', '2002-04-15 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48124, 861, 203, '<td valign="top">Second time around for cards but this one is in focus.</td>', 'Second time around for cards but this one is in focus.', '2002-04-15 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48125, 861, 142, '<td valign="top">Great technique.  The use of the gloved hands makes this an original photo.</td>', 'Great technique.  The use of the gloved hands makes this an original photo.', '2002-04-15 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48126, 861, 527, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. I just don''t like the way the cards are stacked together like that.</td>', 'I love the idea. I just don''t like the way the cards are stacked together like that.', '2002-04-15 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48127, 861, 782, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo</td>', 'Interesting photo', '2002-04-15 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48128, 861, 446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!  Cropped perfectly to my tastes.  The wide depth of field works perfectly here.  My compliments on the sharpness of the photo.  The touch of adding the white gloves for contrast was well thought out.  Looks likes a winner to me and I voted as such.</td>', 'Outstanding!!  Cropped perfectly to my tastes.  The wide depth of field works perfectly here.  My compliments on the sharpness of the photo.  The touch of adding the white gloves for contrast was well thought out.  Looks likes a winner to me and I voted as such.', '2002-04-15 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48129, 861, 661, '<td valign="top">I only see 12.  Good clarity.</td>', 'I only see 12.  Good clarity.', '2002-04-15 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48130, 861, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well-executed setup...</td>', 'Well-executed setup...', '2002-04-15 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
