(48151, 861, 811, '<td valign="top">gloves add a nice effect</td>', 'gloves add a nice effect', '2002-04-19 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48152, 861, 1202, '<td valign="top">The stopped cards give dimension to the magicians gloves.  No distracting background, nice attention to subject matter.</td>', 'The stopped cards give dimension to the magicians gloves.  No distracting background, nice attention to subject matter.', '2002-04-20 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48153, 861, 806, '<td valign="top">nice idea!</td>', 'nice idea!', '2002-04-21 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48154, 861, 1135, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I would like to see more cards in the air.</td>', 'Great lighting, I would like to see more cards in the air.', '2002-04-21 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48155, 861, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice touch, the white gloves.  Can''t think of a thing that I would have done better.</td>', 'Nice touch, the white gloves.  Can''t think of a thing that I would have done better.', '2002-04-21 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48156, 862, 773, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You couldn''t have caught this one any better!  Gorgeous shot!</td>', 'Wow!  You couldn''t have caught this one any better!  Gorgeous shot!', '2002-04-15 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48157, 862, 92, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless. This is a AWESOME shot ! Just beautiful. So nice and clean ! One of my favs for sure:)</td>', 'I''m speechless. This is a AWESOME shot ! Just beautiful. So nice and clean ! One of my favs for sure:)', '2002-04-15 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48158, 862, 656, '<td valign="top">Good capture, well framed - very cleanly done.</td>', 'Good capture, well framed - very cleanly done.', '2002-04-15 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48159, 862, 509, '<td valign="top">Great framing! you really emphasize the bird''s wingspan, awesome pic</td>', 'Great framing! you really emphasize the bird''s wingspan, awesome pic', '2002-04-15 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48160, 862, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite . . . and not just because I love the subject matter.  Beautiful with the sun shining through the feathers - well done!</td>', 'Definitely my favorite . . . and not just because I love the subject matter.  Beautiful with the sun shining through the feathers - well done!', '2002-04-15 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48161, 862, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a difficult photo for me to comment on.  The bird id definitely moving and this is an excellent photograph of that bird.  The composition and all the other techincal elements are right on target.  If this were a birds challenge, you would be getting a 10.  Is this bird gliding?  If so, I wouldn''t think that it''s a great choice for a ''stopped motion'' challenge.  I''m not sure that moving the camera to follow a moving (but stationary) object is a good example of capturing stopped motion.  It would be sorta like photographing a ferarri riding on a flatbed rail car.  Do I make any sense here?</td>', 'This is a difficult photo for me to comment on.  The bird id definitely moving and this is an excellent photograph of that bird.  The composition and all the other techincal elements are right on target.  If this were a birds challenge, you would be getting a 10.  Is this bird gliding?  If so, I wouldn''t think that it''s a great choice for a ''stopped motion'' challenge.  I''m not sure that moving the camera to follow a moving (but stationary) object is a good example of capturing stopped motion.  It would be sorta like photographing a ferarri riding on a flatbed rail car.  Do I make any sense here?', '2002-04-15 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48162, 862, 142, '<td valign="top">Not only is this an excellent photo for the challenge, it is also something I would put on my wall.  I love it!</td>', 'Not only is this an excellent photo for the challenge, it is also something I would put on my wall.  I love it!', '2002-04-15 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48163, 862, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2002-04-15 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48164, 862, 909, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure. The lighting Gods were with you.</td>', 'Very good exposure. The lighting Gods were with you.', '2002-04-15 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48165, 862, 641, '<td valign="top">good close up and good stop motion.</td>', 'good close up and good stop motion.', '2002-04-15 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48166, 862, 885, '<td valign="top">very symmetrical</td>', 'very symmetrical', '2002-04-15 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48167, 862, 661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  Nice highlights.  Looks every so slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  Nice highlights.  Looks every so slightly out of focus.', '2002-04-15 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48168, 862, 308, '<td valign="top">Great framing - I love how the sky looks.</td>', 'Great framing - I love how the sky looks.', '2002-04-15 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48169, 862, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2002-04-15 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48170, 862, 527, '<td valign="top">This is just pretty. And I know how difficult it is to get that kind of shot. This kind of zoom shot certainly narrows you down to just a few people. I love trying guess who''s it is.</td>', 'This is just pretty. And I know how difficult it is to get that kind of shot. This kind of zoom shot certainly narrows you down to just a few people. I love trying guess who''s it is.', '2002-04-15 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48171, 862, 675, '<td valign="top">hard picture to take with such clarity, nice job</td>', 'hard picture to take with such clarity, nice job', '2002-04-15 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48172, 862, 813, '<td valign="top">This ceratinly fits the bill. Good job stopping the action. Very sharp, crisp color. I want to see the bird at an angle or something to lift it a little more off the page visually.</td>', 'This ceratinly fits the bill. Good job stopping the action. Very sharp, crisp color. I want to see the bird at an angle or something to lift it a little more off the page visually.', '2002-04-15 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(48173, 862, 782, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.  Good exposure and very sharp.</td>', 'Excellent picture.  Good exposure and very sharp.', '2002-04-15 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48174, 862, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like it.  I like how you centered the object.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow, I like it.  I like how you centered the object.  Good job.', '2002-04-15 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48175, 862, 724, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and contrast!</td>', 'Beautiful color and contrast!', '2002-04-15 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48176, 862, 1031, '<td valign="top">A beautiful "xray" effect on the wings!</td>', 'A beautiful "xray" effect on the wings!', '2002-04-15 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48177, 862, 797, '<td valign="top">This is truly beautiful. makes us all want to break out and do something different. An unblemished sky, good use of shadows, and of course being able to follow the bird like that makes the shot A++.  I love the way the light pierces through the bird''s feathers and outlines the exoskeleton.</td>', 'This is truly beautiful. makes us all want to break out and do something different. An unblemished sky, good use of shadows, and of course being able to follow the bird like that makes the shot A++.  I love the way the light pierces through the bird''s feathers and outlines the exoskeleton.', '2002-04-16 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48178, 862, 640, '<td valign="top">Absolutly awesome</td>', 'Absolutly awesome', '2002-04-16 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48179, 862, 748, '<td valign="top">I like it ...</td>', 'I like it ...', '2002-04-16 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48180, 862, 2, '<td valign="top">Congrats on catching this difficult subject so nicely.</td>', 'Congrats on catching this difficult subject so nicely.', '2002-04-16 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48181, 862, 441, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, superbly captured</td>', 'beautiful shot, superbly captured', '2002-04-16 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48182, 862, 255, '<td valign="top">beautiful! why can''t i get something like this!:)</td>', 'beautiful! why can''t i get something like this!:)', '2002-04-16 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48183, 862, 205, '<td valign="top">I don''t need to comment for you to know how good your picture is.</td>', 'I don''t need to comment for you to know how good your picture is.', '2002-04-16 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48184, 862, 1064, '<td valign="top">perfect blue sky.</td>', 'perfect blue sky.', '2002-04-16 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48185, 862, 1020, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and color!</td>', 'Excellent shot and color!', '2002-04-17 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48186, 862, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful great egret.  the only thing that could be better would be to have caught him from a different angle such that his lower body isnt in such a drastic shadow as the upper.</td>', 'beautiful great egret.  the only thing that could be better would be to have caught him from a different angle such that his lower body isnt in such a drastic shadow as the upper.', '2002-04-17 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
