(48321, 868, 543, '<td valign="top">Soapy water on glass?  Very 2D look, and missing the feeling of motion somehow.</td>', 'Soapy water on glass?  Very 2D look, and missing the feeling of motion somehow.', '2002-04-18 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
