(48484, 876, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject and there is a LOT of activity in it.  Depth of field plays a great role in a shot like this because of the 3-dimensional distances between all of the water droplets in this photograph.  I believe that you needed a much faster shutter speed and possibly a flash to do a better job of stopping the motion.  There are a lot of motion trails on these water droplets and the fountain streams are showing motion blur as well.</td>', 'This is an interesting subject and there is a LOT of activity in it.  Depth of field plays a great role in a shot like this because of the 3-dimensional distances between all of the water droplets in this photograph.  I believe that you needed a much faster shutter speed and possibly a flash to do a better job of stopping the motion.  There are a lot of motion trails on these water droplets and the fountain streams are showing motion blur as well.', '2002-04-15 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48485, 876, 92, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but there''s just too much streaking from not stopping the action:(</td>', 'Nice idea but there''s just too much streaking from not stopping the action:(', '2002-04-15 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
