(48518, 877, 772, '<td valign="top">I would like to have an autographed print of this one.  You could be the next Robert Maplethorpe.  Did you know that the government funds art like this?  Now, on to the photo...  The subject of your photo, "the flowing stream of urine", is not frozen in time.  You possibly could have fired the flash on this shot, which, in turn, would have frozen the motion and also created a better lighting situation and improved the overall quality of this shot.  You do get extra points for lifting the lid, but those points may be cancelled out by the reduction in score for not replacing the roll of paper last time you visited this location.</td>', 'I would like to have an autographed print of this one.  You could be the next Robert Maplethorpe.  Did you know that the government funds art like this?  Now, on to the photo...  The subject of your photo, "the flowing stream of urine", is not frozen in time.  You possibly could have fired the flash on this shot, which, in turn, would have frozen the motion and also created a better lighting situation and improved the overall quality of this shot.  You do get extra points for lifting the lid, but those points may be cancelled out by the reduction in score for not replacing the roll of paper last time you visited this location.', '2002-04-15 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48519, 877, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Easily the best entry.   Shame about the blurring...</td>', 'Lovely.  Easily the best entry.   Shame about the blurring...', '2002-04-15 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48520, 877, 157, '<td valign="top">ha! that''s great! :P</td>', 'ha! that''s great! :P', '2002-04-15 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48521, 877, 1055, '<td valign="top">this is terrible.  it''s blurry, badly lit, and sick.  i have two tips for you: (1) next time, refill the toilet paper before you pee and (2) never take a picture like this again.</td>', 'this is terrible.  it''s blurry, badly lit, and sick.  i have two tips for you: (1) next time, refill the toilet paper before you pee and (2) never take a picture like this again.', '2002-04-15 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48522, 877, 641, '<td valign="top">Yea, well I didn''t need to see someone peeing. What''s with the toilet issues? But an interesting shot to say the least. White balance is off, and hard to see the stream in this lighting.</td>', 'Yea, well I didn''t need to see someone peeing. What''s with the toilet issues? But an interesting shot to say the least. White balance is off, and hard to see the stream in this lighting.', '2002-04-15 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48523, 877, 714, '<td valign="top">hmmm...not comment</td>', 'hmmm...not comment', '2002-04-15 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48524, 877, 509, '<td valign="top">This is pretty distasteful, the pubic hair picture was o.k., this one is just gross<br/><br/>HOWEVER, it does meet the challenge, and as such I will rate it above the 1 that I instinctively gave<br/><br/>Interested to see what kind of comments this one will spark, I''m guessing this is another one by Ryano?</td>', 'This is pretty distasteful, the pubic hair picture was o.k., this one is just grossHOWEVER, it does meet the challenge, and as such I will rate it above the 1 that I instinctively gaveInterested to see what kind of comments this one will spark, I''m guessing this is another one by Ryano?', '2002-04-15 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48525, 877, 813, '<td valign="top">Ok, if you''re gonna show us a shot of a pee stream at least honor us by doing it well. How? Try backlighting the stream so it can be seen, and use a flash to stop the motion. Sorry but gotta rate this one low :)</td>', 'Ok, if you''re gonna show us a shot of a pee stream at least honor us by doing it well. How? Try backlighting the stream so it can be seen, and use a flash to stop the motion. Sorry but gotta rate this one low :)', '2002-04-15 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48526, 877, 142, '<td valign="top">Gross.  I''m really glad you didn''t show any more details.  At least you met the criteria.</td>', 'Gross.  I''m really glad you didn''t show any more details.  At least you met the criteria.', '2002-04-15 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
