(48530, 877, 203, '<td valign="top">Well it is the most original of the falling water shots.  You got an extra point for that but since nearly everyone did the falling water thing it loses for originality as a concept.</td>', 'Well it is the most original of the falling water shots.  You got an extra point for that but since nearly everyone did the falling water thing it loses for originality as a concept.', '2002-04-15 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
