(48541, 877, 811, '<td valign="top">Brave attempt.  Hope your subject didn''t mind, and I am glad the top of the image stopped where it does. :-)<br/>Seriously -- a different lighting scheme may have made the picture a little more effective.  Also, the "subject" that is to be stopped is almost indistinguishable at first -- it fades into the background.</td>', 'Brave attempt.  Hope your subject didn''t mind, and I am glad the top of the image stopped where it does. :-)Seriously -- a different lighting scheme may have made the picture a little more effective.  Also, the "subject" that is to be stopped is almost indistinguishable at first -- it fades into the background.', '2002-04-17 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
