(48579, 879, 205, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed shot, looks almost out of focus though and whatever light source is being reflected of its tail is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nicely executed shot, looks almost out of focus though and whatever light source is being reflected of its tail is a bit distracting.', '2002-04-16 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
