(48740, 884, 1175, '<td valign="top">No you didn''t. Bad lighting. Face is blurred.</td>', 'No you didn''t. Bad lighting. Face is blurred.', '2002-04-19 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48741, 884, 2, '<td valign="top">Very low lighting.  The subject''s hand is also out of the frame of the picture.  And any chance of a more exciting setting?</td>', 'Very low lighting.  The subject''s hand is also out of the frame of the picture.  And any chance of a more exciting setting?', '2002-04-19 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48742, 884, 142, '<td valign="top">What did he win?</td>', 'What did he win?', '2002-04-19 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48743, 884, 113, '<td valign="top">A little lighter perhaps or more contrast.  Good jump, good shot.</td>', 'A little lighter perhaps or more contrast.  Good jump, good shot.', '2002-04-20 05:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48744, 884, 280, '<td valign="top">lightings not so good.</td>', 'lightings not so good.', '2002-04-20 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48745, 884, 346, '<td valign="top">The subject was out of focus. Better composition may have helped this shot.</td>', 'The subject was out of focus. Better composition may have helped this shot.', '2002-04-20 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48746, 884, 739, '<td valign="top">You don''t look too excited that you won.</td>', 'You don''t look too excited that you won.', '2002-04-20 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48747, 884, 1, '<td valign="top">You clipped his hand.  Also the colors seem a bit dark/saturated.</td>', 'You clipped his hand.  Also the colors seem a bit dark/saturated.', '2002-04-21 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48748, 884, 889, '<td valign="top">you might want to try getting a a soft white light for illumination indoors because most<br/>camera flashes arnt good past about 9 feet. The combination of the back light from the<br/>window and the weak flash make this a dark picture. Also some cameras adjust exposure<br/>based on the brightest source it can see.</td>', 'you might want to try getting a a soft white light for illumination indoors because mostcamera flashes arnt good past about 9 feet. The combination of the back light from thewindow and the weak flash make this a dark picture. Also some cameras adjust exposurebased on the brightest source it can see.', '2002-04-21 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48749, 884, 806, '<td valign="top">out of focus and too dark.</td>', 'out of focus and too dark.', '2002-04-21 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48750, 884, 1242, '<td valign="top">Nice composition... a bit blurry though.</td>', 'Nice composition... a bit blurry though.', '2002-04-21 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48751, 886, 656, '<td valign="top">cool environmental portrait of this guy working.  Bit blurred though - some flash might have helped stop everything more effectively.</td>', 'cool environmental portrait of this guy working.  Bit blurred though - some flash might have helped stop everything more effectively.', '2002-04-15 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48752, 886, 156, '<td valign="top">nice concept but i can''t see the utensils which seem to be blurry, the object being tossed about definitely is...i wonder if using flash would have helped</td>', 'nice concept but i can''t see the utensils which seem to be blurry, the object being tossed about definitely is...i wonder if using flash would have helped', '2002-04-15 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48753, 886, 1055, '<td valign="top">this is a good idea, but unfortunately, the egg has motion lines and the lighting is not great</td>', 'this is a good idea, but unfortunately, the egg has motion lines and the lighting is not great', '2002-04-15 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48754, 886, 1024, '<td valign="top">I wish the lighting on his face was a little better.  Overall a great picture though.</td>', 'I wish the lighting on his face was a little better.  Overall a great picture though.', '2002-04-15 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48755, 886, 641, '<td valign="top">Good subject and cool lighting, but the round object is a little blurry.</td>', 'Good subject and cool lighting, but the round object is a little blurry.', '2002-04-15 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48756, 886, 361, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Looks like the lighting did not allow for perfect "stopped motion" of the ball.</td>', 'Too dark. Looks like the lighting did not allow for perfect "stopped motion" of the ball.', '2002-04-15 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48757, 886, 813, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, a vertical crop and a little more exposure would improve greatly</td>', 'nice lighting, a vertical crop and a little more exposure would improve greatly', '2002-04-15 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48758, 886, 772, '<td valign="top">I wanted to try this shot myself.  Poverty keeps me out of the Japanese Steak Houses most of the time :)  I do see motion blur in the (is that an egg or an onion?) and in the spatula.  It is very difficult to shoot ''stoped motion'' shots in dark conditions without a flash.  Your camera senses the darkness and lengthens the exposure time accordingly.</td>', 'I wanted to try this shot myself.  Poverty keeps me out of the Japanese Steak Houses most of the time :)  I do see motion blur in the (is that an egg or an onion?) and in the spatula.  It is very difficult to shoot ''stoped motion'' shots in dark conditions without a flash.  Your camera senses the darkness and lengthens the exposure time accordingly.', '2002-04-15 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48759, 886, 92, '<td valign="top">A *little* too dark but the light is on the main subject which is great:) Nice idea and capture:)</td>', 'A *little* too dark but the light is on the main subject which is great:) Nice idea and capture:)', '2002-04-15 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48760, 886, 885, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting on the chef</td>', 'i like the lighting on the chef', '2002-04-15 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48761, 886, 714, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really bad.  I would like it if I could see it.  Sorry</td>', 'The lighting is really bad.  I would like it if I could see it.  Sorry', '2002-04-15 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48762, 886, 1031, '<td valign="top">Must have been hard to do in such a low-light setting.</td>', 'Must have been hard to do in such a low-light setting.', '2002-04-15 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48763, 886, 689, '<td valign="top">Not bad, considering the low light ... I like the choice of not using a flash .. .they are overrated!</td>', 'Not bad, considering the low light ... I like the choice of not using a flash .. .they are overrated!', '2002-04-16 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48764, 886, 441, '<td valign="top">interesting shot  - object not quite stopped</td>', 'interesting shot  - object not quite stopped', '2002-04-16 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48765, 886, 445, '<td valign="top">Great idea but not stopped cleanly.</td>', 'Great idea but not stopped cleanly.', '2002-04-16 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48766, 886, 258, '<td valign="top"><br/>I still see a little motion blur.  ;-)</td>', 'I still see a little motion blur.  ;-)', '2002-04-16 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
