(48769, 886, 301, '<td valign="top">pic is a bit too dark.  You might want to crop and centre on the chef, as the background isn''t really that interesting anyway.  Shame the egg got blurred too.</td>', 'pic is a bit too dark.  You might want to crop and centre on the chef, as the background isn''t really that interesting anyway.  Shame the egg got blurred too.', '2002-04-17 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
