(48787, 886, 1240, '<td valign="top">Simply put: "Just plain beautiful!"</td>', 'Simply put: "Just plain beautiful!"', '2002-04-21 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48788, 886, 245, '<td valign="top">the chef is in such sharp detail for lighting that low! nice!</td>', 'the chef is in such sharp detail for lighting that low! nice!', '2002-04-22 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48789, 887, 107, '<td valign="top">a bit dull.</td>', 'a bit dull.', '2002-04-15 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48790, 887, 92, '<td valign="top">The main subject isn''t the main focus of your picture. Maybe a close up with not so many other objects in your picture would make this a much better capture:)</td>', 'The main subject isn''t the main focus of your picture. Maybe a close up with not so many other objects in your picture would make this a much better capture:)', '2002-04-15 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48791, 887, 1055, '<td valign="top">i really don''t like this.  there is almost no motion, and the lack of a central focal point or symettry really takes away from the picture.</td>', 'i really don''t like this.  there is almost no motion, and the lack of a central focal point or symettry really takes away from the picture.', '2002-04-15 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48792, 887, 772, '<td valign="top">He''s moving alright... It''s ashame that his left foot appears to have a little motion blur.  Since the man walking is the subject of your photo, I would like to have seen him taking up much more of the frame.  These cars need to be gone or be more dominant in the photo as well.  Please correct me if I''m wrong, but are you shooting this photo through a window?  I see two lines moving from the bottom top of this photo... The first one is in front of the man passing under his chin and the second is leaving from the rear corner of the SUV... both carry over into the grass.  Are these possibly refelctions from inside the window?</td>', 'He''s moving alright... It''s ashame that his left foot appears to have a little motion blur.  Since the man walking is the subject of your photo, I would like to have seen him taking up much more of the frame.  These cars need to be gone or be more dominant in the photo as well.  Please correct me if I''m wrong, but are you shooting this photo through a window?  I see two lines moving from the bottom top of this photo... The first one is in front of the man passing under his chin and the second is leaving from the rear corner of the SUV... both carry over into the grass.  Are these possibly refelctions from inside the window?', '2002-04-15 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48793, 887, 509, '<td valign="top">not much action here, cropping is off as well</td>', 'not much action here, cropping is off as well', '2002-04-15 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48794, 887, 813, '<td valign="top">looks like you were nearly as desparate as I was to capture something moving</td>', 'looks like you were nearly as desparate as I was to capture something moving', '2002-04-15 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48795, 887, 139, '<td valign="top">Looks like slow motion to me :)  The cars are rather distracting.</td>', 'Looks like slow motion to me :)  The cars are rather distracting.', '2002-04-15 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48796, 887, 656, '<td valign="top">The surroudings are too cluttered for this to really stand out.  You''ve cropped his feet a bit too.</td>', 'The surroudings are too cluttered for this to really stand out.  You''ve cropped his feet a bit too.', '2002-04-15 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48797, 887, 312, '<td valign="top">this is brilliant. if those cars weren''t there, i''d give you a 10. this guy is the epitome of all that is good and right in this world.</td>', 'this is brilliant. if those cars weren''t there, i''d give you a 10. this guy is the epitome of all that is good and right in this world.', '2002-04-15 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48798, 887, 782, '<td valign="top">lacks imagination</td>', 'lacks imagination', '2002-04-15 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48799, 887, 1, '<td valign="top">Not too much stopped motion here.</td>', 'Not too much stopped motion here.', '2002-04-15 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48800, 887, 113, '<td valign="top">Yep, you can tell he''s moving.  Just not real interesting.  Placement of subject lacks also.</td>', 'Yep, you can tell he''s moving.  Just not real interesting.  Placement of subject lacks also.', '2002-04-16 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48801, 887, 361, '<td valign="top">Kind of boring picture. Feet are a bit blurry. ??motion not stopped??</td>', 'Kind of boring picture. Feet are a bit blurry. ??motion not stopped??', '2002-04-16 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48802, 887, 441, '<td valign="top">not much effort gone into this one.</td>', 'not much effort gone into this one.', '2002-04-16 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48803, 887, 145, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot and the backs of the two parked cars detract from the shot.</td>', 'The angle of the shot and the backs of the two parked cars detract from the shot.', '2002-04-16 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48804, 887, 301, '<td valign="top">motion needs to be faster for my vote.  Also a rather uninteresting scene</td>', 'motion needs to be faster for my vote.  Also a rather uninteresting scene', '2002-04-17 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48805, 887, 671, '<td valign="top">Good focus, not well centered.</td>', 'Good focus, not well centered.', '2002-04-17 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48806, 887, 811, '<td valign="top">IMO, there is too much stuff in this picture.  Maybe focusing on just the man would''ve been mire effective.  Are the diagonal lines on the road, or are they relflections or glare?</td>', 'IMO, there is too much stuff in this picture.  Maybe focusing on just the man would''ve been mire effective.  Are the diagonal lines on the road, or are they relflections or glare?', '2002-04-17 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48807, 887, 749, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer this if it was either centred on the walker, or with him just about the leave the frame. Pity the cars are in shot.</td>', 'I''d prefer this if it was either centred on the walker, or with him just about the leave the frame. Pity the cars are in shot.', '2002-04-17 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48808, 887, 2, '<td valign="top">A setting is crucial for any photograph -- but this one has too many competing elements.</td>', 'A setting is crucial for any photograph -- but this one has too many competing elements.', '2002-04-18 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48809, 887, 1041, '<td valign="top">The cars at the bottom of the picture are distracting, this looks just like a quick shot out of the window to me, sorry.  A different angle, and maybe the person more close-up would have helped me.</td>', 'The cars at the bottom of the picture are distracting, this looks just like a quick shot out of the window to me, sorry.  A different angle, and maybe the person more close-up would have helped me.', '2002-04-18 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48810, 887, 472, '<td valign="top">I *know* you could have found a more interesting subject than this!  don''t just accept what''s outside your apartment window, actually go out into the world!</td>', 'I *know* you could have found a more interesting subject than this!  don''t just accept what''s outside your apartment window, actually go out into the world!', '2002-04-18 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48811, 887, 205, '<td valign="top">Nothing about this picture does it for me, sure he''s walking but thats only because of a motion trail, other wise I would have thought maybe you told him to put his foot up to give the appearance that he was walking the cars on bottom are  upsetting. next time get closer and have both feet in the air that would make a believable stop motion</td>', 'Nothing about this picture does it for me, sure he''s walking but thats only because of a motion trail, other wise I would have thought maybe you told him to put his foot up to give the appearance that he was walking the cars on bottom are  upsetting. next time get closer and have both feet in the air that would make a believable stop motion', '2002-04-18 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48812, 887, 933, '<td valign="top">composition could be better, those cars are really distracting</td>', 'composition could be better, those cars are really distracting', '2002-04-18 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48813, 887, 245, '<td valign="top">i''d try to get his feet off the bottom edge of the picture, and is that the reflection of a tripod I see? :)</td>', 'i''d try to get his feet off the bottom edge of the picture, and is that the reflection of a tripod I see? :)', '2002-04-19 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48814, 887, 797, '<td valign="top">not very stop-action and subject could be more emphasised?</td>', 'not very stop-action and subject could be more emphasised?', '2002-04-19 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48815, 887, 1175, '<td valign="top">More excitement needed.</td>', 'More excitement needed.', '2002-04-19 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48816, 887, 878, '<td valign="top">Motion is stopped in this shot but the shot itself is not grabbing attention to the man''s motion.  Perhaps if he was walking further away from the cars and you were zoomed in more it would of conveyed the stop motion concept.</td>', 'Motion is stopped in this shot but the shot itself is not grabbing attention to the man''s motion.  Perhaps if he was walking further away from the cars and you were zoomed in more it would of conveyed the stop motion concept.', '2002-04-19 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
