(48864, 888, 543, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  The lighting and placement on the toast and toaster is just perfect.  I don''t like the side lighting on your friend, though, and can''t help but wonder how this would look from a lower angle.  I think it would draw the viewer into the odd scene more to be a little under the toaster, and it would get the line of the mountains out from behind your head.  Still... very cool.</td>', 'Really cool.  The lighting and placement on the toast and toaster is just perfect.  I don''t like the side lighting on your friend, though, and can''t help but wonder how this would look from a lower angle.  I think it would draw the viewer into the odd scene more to be a little under the toaster, and it would get the line of the mountains out from behind your head.  Still... very cool.', '2002-04-18 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
