(48914, 889, 245, '<td valign="top">the skyscrapers and lamp post make this picture feel pretty cramped, as does the sliver of vehickle on the left. a wider angle would be nice.</td>', 'the skyscrapers and lamp post make this picture feel pretty cramped, as does the sliver of vehickle on the left. a wider angle would be nice.', '2002-04-18 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48915, 889, 933, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft.  No appearent subject...</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft.  No appearent subject...', '2002-04-18 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48916, 889, 811, '<td valign="top">Comes up a little flat to me.  The pole (?) in the middle is also distracting.  Next time, get out, cut the pole down, then take your picture.  Just kidding.  Probably seems that traffic moves this fast in actuality sometimes, huh?</td>', 'Comes up a little flat to me.  The pole (?) in the middle is also distracting.  Next time, get out, cut the pole down, then take your picture.  Just kidding.  Probably seems that traffic moves this fast in actuality sometimes, huh?', '2002-04-18 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48917, 889, 1141, '<td valign="top">The picture seems grainy.</td>', 'The picture seems grainy.', '2002-04-18 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48918, 889, 797, '<td valign="top">not very interesting, though.</td>', 'not very interesting, though.', '2002-04-19 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48919, 889, 862, '<td valign="top">How''d you get all those people to stop in the road.  Oh, wait, that''s normal.</td>', 'How''d you get all those people to stop in the road.  Oh, wait, that''s normal.', '2002-04-19 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48920, 889, 889, '<td valign="top">Interesing shot I might have tried cropping out the bus in the back right but since I dont know how<br/>the bus to the far left appears If i had to guess I would say this was somplace in Japan, but what do I an american know. ;)<br/></td>', 'Interesing shot I might have tried cropping out the bus in the back right but since I dont know howthe bus to the far left appears If i had to guess I would say this was somplace in Japan, but what do I an american know. ;)', '2002-04-19 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48921, 889, 1175, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really do anything for me.</td>', 'Doesn''t really do anything for me.', '2002-04-19 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48922, 889, 689, '<td valign="top">Motion is stopped pretty well, but seems out of focus ...</td>', 'Motion is stopped pretty well, but seems out of focus ...', '2002-04-19 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48923, 889, 142, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing the stopped motion.</td>', 'Good job of capturing the stopped motion.', '2002-04-19 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48924, 889, 1202, '<td valign="top">I have to agree, those commutes are boring.</td>', 'I have to agree, those commutes are boring.', '2002-04-20 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48925, 889, 637, '<td valign="top">nothing special about the image, although reasonably done</td>', 'nothing special about the image, although reasonably done', '2002-04-20 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48926, 889, 346, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what it is, but there is something flat about this picture. Wish I could express it better.</td>', 'I am not sure what it is, but there is something flat about this picture. Wish I could express it better.', '2002-04-21 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48927, 889, 1, '<td valign="top">While this shot does constitute stopped action, it is a little bland.</td>', 'While this shot does constitute stopped action, it is a little bland.', '2002-04-21 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48928, 889, 806, '<td valign="top">background more in focus than passing car, but nice.</td>', 'background more in focus than passing car, but nice.', '2002-04-21 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48929, 890, 1055, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2002-04-15 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48930, 890, 279, '<td valign="top">It''s neither stopped motion... Nor in focus.</td>', 'It''s neither stopped motion... Nor in focus.', '2002-04-15 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48931, 890, 641, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the subject matter, but just too blurry.</td>', 'I love the colors and the subject matter, but just too blurry.', '2002-04-15 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48932, 890, 885, '<td valign="top">blurry, weird disembodied feet in background</td>', 'blurry, weird disembodied feet in background', '2002-04-15 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48933, 890, 92, '<td valign="top">Way too much going on in this photo to see the stop action. Not a nice clean capture and the skin tones aren''t the best:( At first I thought this was a scanned photo. I don''t mean to offend but I do want to be honest:) A closer more focused shot of your subject would have been much better. I hope this is a helpful critque.</td>', 'Way too much going on in this photo to see the stop action. Not a nice clean capture and the skin tones aren''t the best:( At first I thought this was a scanned photo. I don''t mean to offend but I do want to be honest:) A closer more focused shot of your subject would have been much better. I hope this is a helpful critque.', '2002-04-15 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48934, 890, 139, '<td valign="top">Good idea</td>', 'Good idea', '2002-04-15 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48935, 890, 656, '<td valign="top">Seems quite blurred  - did you move while you took it ?</td>', 'Seems quite blurred  - did you move while you took it ?', '2002-04-15 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48936, 890, 772, '<td valign="top">Your subject IS working but your autofocus may be failing.  This shot is out of focus.</td>', 'Your subject IS working but your autofocus may be failing.  This shot is out of focus.', '2002-04-15 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48937, 890, 509, '<td valign="top">looks out of focus</td>', 'looks out of focus', '2002-04-15 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48938, 890, 203, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but needs focus.</td>', 'Interesting shot but needs focus.', '2002-04-15 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48939, 890, 441, '<td valign="top">interesting pic but motion not stopped - see guys left foot at back of shot. - also either focus out, or camera shake evident in this photo.</td>', 'interesting pic but motion not stopped - see guys left foot at back of shot. - also either focus out, or camera shake evident in this photo.', '2002-04-15 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48940, 890, 661, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus.  Interesting subject.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus.  Interesting subject.', '2002-04-15 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48941, 890, 782, '<td valign="top">Focus not sharp</td>', 'Focus not sharp', '2002-04-15 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48942, 890, 813, '<td valign="top">Better focus would help.</td>', 'Better focus would help.', '2002-04-15 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48943, 890, 536, '<td valign="top">a little blurry but for this photo it works for me.</td>', 'a little blurry but for this photo it works for me.', '2002-04-15 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48944, 890, 361, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if you got closer to your subject or cropped closer to the subject. Also, looks like you might have needed a faster shutter speed to really stop the motion, but it''s hard to tell.<br/></td>', 'I think it would be better if you got closer to your subject or cropped closer to the subject. Also, looks like you might have needed a faster shutter speed to really stop the motion, but it''s hard to tell.', '2002-04-15 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48945, 890, 352, '<td valign="top">Appears a bit blurry.</td>', 'Appears a bit blurry.', '2002-04-15 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48946, 890, 724, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2002-04-15 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48947, 890, 910, '<td valign="top">blurry</td>', 'blurry', '2002-04-16 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48948, 890, 245, '<td valign="top">it looks like you have some hand shake, try propping the camera against something, or practice holding it still, bracing your arms against your body. I can never hold a camera still, alas.</td>', 'it looks like you have some hand shake, try propping the camera against something, or practice holding it still, bracing your arms against your body. I can never hold a camera still, alas.', '2002-04-16 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48949, 890, 640, '<td valign="top">Is it Sam tam for lunch?</td>', 'Is it Sam tam for lunch?', '2002-04-16 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48950, 890, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve gotten enough comments about the blur, but it''s very distracting from the image.  A lower angle might also have made this shot more immediate.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve gotten enough comments about the blur, but it''s very distracting from the image.  A lower angle might also have made this shot more immediate.', '2002-04-16 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48951, 890, 933, '<td valign="top">Rather out of focus</td>', 'Rather out of focus', '2002-04-17 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48952, 890, 587, '<td valign="top">wish this was less blurry and less distraction in background. Interesting though!</td>', 'wish this was less blurry and less distraction in background. Interesting though!', '2002-04-17 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48953, 890, 472, '<td valign="top">hmm.  i know the water is dripping, but there is no real sense of ''stopped motion'' in this shot.  you could prolly have had a better picture just doing a sharp candid,- the water stream wouldnt have come out any better but your picture itself would be more useable.</td>', 'hmm.  i know the water is dripping, but there is no real sense of ''stopped motion'' in this shot.  you could prolly have had a better picture just doing a sharp candid,- the water stream wouldnt have come out any better but your picture itself would be more useable.', '2002-04-18 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48954, 890, 671, '<td valign="top">good subject, nice colors, needs sharper focus.</td>', 'good subject, nice colors, needs sharper focus.', '2002-04-18 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(48955, 890, 205, '<td valign="top">unfocused</td>', 'unfocused', '2002-04-18 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
