(49022, 896, 772, '<td valign="top">You are much more patient that I am.  I hope you didn''t have to sit all day waiting on this photo!  This is an intriguing photo.  To create a higher level of ''visual impact'' with this shot, I would have attempted to zoom tighter or possibly crop much tighter around this bird.  I also realize that this photo can''t be recreated at will and I commend your choice of subject for this challenge!</td>', 'You are much more patient that I am.  I hope you didn''t have to sit all day waiting on this photo!  This is an intriguing photo.  To create a higher level of ''visual impact'' with this shot, I would have attempted to zoom tighter or possibly crop much tighter around this bird.  I also realize that this photo can''t be recreated at will and I commend your choice of subject for this challenge!', '2002-04-15 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
