(49064, 897, 813, '<td valign="top">Wow, good action capture. Something bothers me though, maybe it''s that the pins in motion are horizontal and nearly aligned to each other so the action is not as obvious as it would be if they were scatterd across the frame at angles. No criticism, just an observation. Bet it took a lot of shots to get this. :)</td>', 'Wow, good action capture. Something bothers me though, maybe it''s that the pins in motion are horizontal and nearly aligned to each other so the action is not as obvious as it would be if they were scatterd across the frame at angles. No criticism, just an observation. Bet it took a lot of shots to get this. :)', '2002-04-15 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
