(49217, 902, 884, '<td valign="top">Simple, but I love the pinkish tint and the humanly shape it forms. Pretty neat.</td>', 'Simple, but I love the pinkish tint and the humanly shape it forms. Pretty neat.', '2002-04-15 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
