(49219, 902, 113, '<td valign="top">I tried and tried to get one like this.  Like the color in the water and the shadow adds to the interest.</td>', 'I tried and tried to get one like this.  Like the color in the water and the shadow adds to the interest.', '2002-04-16 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
