(49237, 902, 1175, '<td valign="top">Lighting a problem.</td>', 'Lighting a problem.', '2002-04-19 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49238, 902, 2, '<td valign="top">Not sure if anyone else has pointed this out, but that water looks like a person with his arm up, shooting out of the bowl.  I think you really could have used the reflection and transparency of the water in combination with a more exciting background to make this shot better.</td>', 'Not sure if anyone else has pointed this out, but that water looks like a person with his arm up, shooting out of the bowl.  I think you really could have used the reflection and transparency of the water in combination with a more exciting background to make this shot better.', '2002-04-19 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49239, 902, 811, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like an ice sculpture.</td>', 'This almost looks like an ice sculpture.', '2002-04-19 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49240, 902, 361, '<td valign="top">This splash almost looks like the shape of a person!</td>', 'This splash almost looks like the shape of a person!', '2002-04-19 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49241, 902, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very good stop action of an old subject.   Might be better in a Patriotism category, or am I the only one that sees the Statue of liberty.</td>', 'Very good stop action of an old subject.   Might be better in a Patriotism category, or am I the only one that sees the Statue of liberty.', '2002-04-20 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49242, 902, 1, '<td valign="top">Looks like a silver grammy.  Nice pinkish tint in the bottom.</td>', 'Looks like a silver grammy.  Nice pinkish tint in the bottom.', '2002-04-20 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49243, 902, 280, '<td valign="top">Thanks all.<br/><br/>I am aware that it looks like a person, hence the title Naiad which is a mythical water sprite. I spent most of my spare time during the week trying to capture birds and insects in flight. I finally gave up when it went dark on Sunday night and did this as a bit of a last minute job, so I am quite pleased it did as well as it has done.<br/></td>', 'Thanks all.I am aware that it looks like a person, hence the title Naiad which is a mythical water sprite. I spent most of my spare time during the week trying to capture birds and insects in flight. I finally gave up when it went dark on Sunday night and did this as a bit of a last minute job, so I am quite pleased it did as well as it has done.', '2002-04-22 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49244, 902, 472, '<td valign="top">tom, i''m sorry that I''m the only person who knew what a naiad was : (</td>', 'tom, i''m sorry that I''m the only person who knew what a naiad was : (', '2002-04-22 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49245, 903, 107, '<td valign="top">nice use of colour in all of the blocks.</td>', 'nice use of colour in all of the blocks.', '2002-04-15 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49246, 903, 656, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, just isn''t very attention grabbing.</td>', 'meets the challenge, just isn''t very attention grabbing.', '2002-04-15 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49247, 903, 139, '<td valign="top">Nice title, interesting picture.</td>', 'Nice title, interesting picture.', '2002-04-15 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49248, 903, 189, '<td valign="top">oooh I had those things when i was littel. What were they called again? :Learning Rods??</td>', 'oooh I had those things when i was littel. What were they called again? :Learning Rods??', '2002-04-15 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49249, 903, 203, '<td valign="top">Much more original than falling water.  I like the concept but the photo seems unfocused.</td>', 'Much more original than falling water.  I like the concept but the photo seems unfocused.', '2002-04-15 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49250, 903, 748, '<td valign="top">The shadows provide the evidence of motion quite well.  Wish it had been framed to leave out all the blank space.</td>', 'The shadows provide the evidence of motion quite well.  Wish it had been framed to leave out all the blank space.', '2002-04-15 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49251, 903, 641, '<td valign="top">cool shot.. I like it except the colors could be brighter</td>', 'cool shot.. I like it except the colors could be brighter', '2002-04-15 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49252, 903, 441, '<td valign="top">nice colours and well stopped but lack of careful cropping lets it down.</td>', 'nice colours and well stopped but lack of careful cropping lets it down.', '2002-04-15 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49253, 903, 813, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. Unique composition, it works somehow. The white area to the left creates a little tension.</td>', 'Pretty good. Unique composition, it works somehow. The white area to the left creates a little tension.', '2002-04-15 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49254, 903, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice stopped motion shot.  I''m not in agreement with the framing... I would rather see the blocks in the center of this image and would have rather seen the image vertical instead of horizonta.</td>', 'This is a nice stopped motion shot.  I''m not in agreement with the framing... I would rather see the blocks in the center of this image and would have rather seen the image vertical instead of horizonta.', '2002-04-15 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49255, 903, 536, '<td valign="top">I like this. I also like that the focus and lighting  isn''t perfect.</td>', 'I like this. I also like that the focus and lighting  isn''t perfect.', '2002-04-15 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49256, 903, 1031, '<td valign="top">I used Cuisenaire Rods when I was a kid!</td>', 'I used Cuisenaire Rods when I was a kid!', '2002-04-15 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49257, 903, 689, '<td valign="top">Framing is a little off and too small of a f stop for the depth of the objects .... good idea ... nice colors</td>', 'Framing is a little off and too small of a f stop for the depth of the objects .... good idea ... nice colors', '2002-04-16 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49258, 903, 640, '<td valign="top">colorful. a little out of focus</td>', 'colorful. a little out of focus', '2002-04-17 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49259, 903, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the way you cropped this one. Also like the way the shadows add depth to the picture.</td>', 'I like the way you cropped this one. Also like the way the shadows add depth to the picture.', '2002-04-17 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49260, 903, 671, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action!  I like the fact that the blocks are to the right of center.</td>', 'Nice stop action!  I like the fact that the blocks are to the right of center.', '2002-04-17 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49261, 903, 811, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t like the empty space on the left.  At my second look, though, I think it gives it motion.  Eliminating the dark blocks and using only the bright ones would''ve added a neat effect, too.</td>', 'At first, I didn''t like the empty space on the left.  At my second look, though, I think it gives it motion.  Eliminating the dark blocks and using only the bright ones would''ve added a neat effect, too.', '2002-04-17 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49262, 903, 1132, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the chaos of the falling blocks. My only wish is that the image was a little sharper.</td>', 'I like the colors and the chaos of the falling blocks. My only wish is that the image was a little sharper.', '2002-04-17 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49263, 903, 749, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, but feels a bit too bright.</td>', 'I love the composition, but feels a bit too bright.', '2002-04-17 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49264, 903, 933, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy. Interesting composition though.  Maybe would have been a little better without the shadows.</td>', 'A little fuzzy. Interesting composition though.  Maybe would have been a little better without the shadows.', '2002-04-17 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49265, 903, 205, '<td valign="top">I think that having a different lighting angle would have made this better plus parts of it are out of focus</td>', 'I think that having a different lighting angle would have made this better plus parts of it are out of focus', '2002-04-18 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49266, 903, 980, '<td valign="top">i really like the positive and negative play, and love the colours</td>', 'i really like the positive and negative play, and love the colours', '2002-04-18 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49267, 903, 301, '<td valign="top">like the placement of the blocks in the photo.  Harsh flash causes distracting shadows tho.  Good effort freezing the action.</td>', 'like the placement of the blocks in the photo.  Harsh flash causes distracting shadows tho.  Good effort freezing the action.', '2002-04-18 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49268, 903, 361, '<td valign="top">Focus almost seems a little fuzzy. Looks like your lighting was from a different angle than direct from the camera --based on the shadows. I like that. Did you drop the blocks from top to bottom in fromt of a wall? Or are we looking down at a table? Just curious... doesn''t affect the photo quality.</td>', 'Focus almost seems a little fuzzy. Looks like your lighting was from a different angle than direct from the camera --based on the shadows. I like that. Did you drop the blocks from top to bottom in fromt of a wall? Or are we looking down at a table? Just curious... doesn''t affect the photo quality.', '2002-04-18 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49269, 903, 1078, '<td valign="top">I totally dig the way this looks like cubist art.  First, a suggestion: I wish that it didn''t feel like such a soft focus, even on the pieces that are in the focal plane.  Second, a purely subjective preference: I would like this even more as something I''d be interested in hanging if the pieces were made up of less earthy colors and more basic primaries, although I recognize you have to work with what you have.  (Hope that makes sense.)</td>', 'I totally dig the way this looks like cubist art.  First, a suggestion: I wish that it didn''t feel like such a soft focus, even on the pieces that are in the focal plane.  Second, a purely subjective preference: I would like this even more as something I''d be interested in hanging if the pieces were made up of less earthy colors and more basic primaries, although I recognize you have to work with what you have.  (Hope that makes sense.)', '2002-04-18 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49270, 903, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  This would have been much better with a softer color for the background and less shadow.  Overall the effect is great.  It is sort of an abstract photo.</td>', 'Nice idea.  This would have been much better with a softer color for the background and less shadow.  Overall the effect is great.  It is sort of an abstract photo.', '2002-04-18 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49271, 903, 245, '<td valign="top">i think this would be a lot nice with a bit more contrast, maybe even blowing out the wall, which looks a little dirty as is. :) But I like it!</td>', 'i think this would be a lot nice with a bit more contrast, maybe even blowing out the wall, which looks a little dirty as is. :) But I like it!', '2002-04-19 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49272, 903, 797, '<td valign="top">not terribly interesting but stop action alright.</td>', 'not terribly interesting but stop action alright.', '2002-04-19 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49273, 903, 2, '<td valign="top">The originality here is great, and so are the colors -- though I think the off-white might be the wrong color to bring out the vibrance of these blocks.  Maybe cover it with white paper?  My favorite part of this picture is the memory it brings back -- i remember these blocks!!!  Ahh... childhood.</td>', 'The originality here is great, and so are the colors -- though I think the off-white might be the wrong color to bring out the vibrance of these blocks.  Maybe cover it with white paper?  My favorite part of this picture is the memory it brings back -- i remember these blocks!!!  Ahh... childhood.', '2002-04-19 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49274, 903, 1184, '<td valign="top">Weighted al little too far right. Many leading lines, yet no anchor.</td>', 'Weighted al little too far right. Many leading lines, yet no anchor.', '2002-04-19 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49275, 903, 543, '<td valign="top">The colors are good (slight yellow cast), and I like the composition.  Would be much better without the shadows on the bg, though.  Moving away from the wall and/or using a light off to one side rather than an on-camera flash would help.</td>', 'The colors are good (slight yellow cast), and I like the composition.  Would be much better without the shadows on the bg, though.  Moving away from the wall and/or using a light off to one side rather than an on-camera flash would help.', '2002-04-19 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49276, 903, 113, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Don''t think macro was the way to go with this one, as it gives you blur when the challenge called for no trails.  Leaving the left side of the photo also takes away from your subject.</td>', 'Good idea.  Don''t think macro was the way to go with this one, as it gives you blur when the challenge called for no trails.  Leaving the left side of the photo also takes away from your subject.', '2002-04-20 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49277, 903, 1175, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is cool.  Very abstract.</td>', 'Wow.  That is cool.  Very abstract.', '2002-04-20 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49278, 903, 1202, '<td valign="top">This stopped motion, and would be of the clearest state if the focus could have been more defined.   A good job of leaving all other elements out of the picture.</td>', 'This stopped motion, and would be of the clearest state if the focus could have been more defined.   A good job of leaving all other elements out of the picture.', '2002-04-20 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49279, 903, 637, '<td valign="top">colorful and clever, but not w/o trails</td>', 'colorful and clever, but not w/o trails', '2002-04-20 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49280, 903, 1, '<td valign="top">The shadows casted are pretty cool, though the subject might be a little bland.</td>', 'The shadows casted are pretty cool, though the subject might be a little bland.', '2002-04-21 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49281, 903, 889, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition</td>', 'Interesting composition', '2002-04-21 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49282, 903, 1135, '<td valign="top">Focus</td>', 'Focus', '2002-04-21 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49283, 903, 472, '<td valign="top">comments are as always appreciated.  people of dpchallenge rule!  : )</td>', 'comments are as always appreciated.  people of dpchallenge rule!  : )', '2002-04-27 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49284, 903, 472, '<td valign="top">oh yeah, it wasnt really a macro. i was just trying to imply that we were looking at the building blocks of the universe through a powerful magnifying lens</td>', 'oh yeah, it wasnt really a macro. i was just trying to imply that we were looking at the building blocks of the universe through a powerful magnifying lens', '2002-04-27 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49285, 904, 107, '<td valign="top">a closer crop might have helped a bit</td>', 'a closer crop might have helped a bit', '2002-04-15 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49286, 904, 156, '<td valign="top">background''s too busy but otherwise a great capture</td>', 'background''s too busy but otherwise a great capture', '2002-04-15 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49287, 904, 92, '<td valign="top">GREAT concept. The only thing I see that would help is there is just too much going on in the background that takes away from your main subject. Maybe a closer shot or taken with him coming towards the camera from a different angle would have helped.</td>', 'GREAT concept. The only thing I see that would help is there is just too much going on in the background that takes away from your main subject. Maybe a closer shot or taken with him coming towards the camera from a different angle would have helped.', '2002-04-15 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49288, 904, 656, '<td valign="top">good stopped motion, but could have been a lot more dramatic if you''d tried a lower angle ?  Good that you framed the guy and his shadow - maybe could have been closer and filled the frame more ?</td>', 'good stopped motion, but could have been a lot more dramatic if you''d tried a lower angle ?  Good that you framed the guy and his shadow - maybe could have been closer and filled the frame more ?', '2002-04-15 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49289, 904, 813, '<td valign="top">Good action. Would love to see it cropped closer to make subject more prominent.</td>', 'Good action. Would love to see it cropped closer to make subject more prominent.', '2002-04-15 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49290, 904, 734, '<td valign="top">might have been cooler shot from the other side.. nice job</td>', 'might have been cooler shot from the other side.. nice job', '2002-04-15 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49291, 904, 279, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool shot, I like the shadow, but the black and white I''m not sure was a good idea. Against that background the black clothing just makes him fade to where you can barely see him. (Or her, to be fair!)</td>', 'It''s a cool shot, I like the shadow, but the black and white I''m not sure was a good idea. Against that background the black clothing just makes him fade to where you can barely see him. (Or her, to be fair!)', '2002-04-15 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49292, 904, 772, '<td valign="top">I like black and whites and I plan to try to incorporate that into challenges in the future myself.  I like the action in this shot.  I would like it better if the skater was not centered in the frame.... Subject orientation to the upper left a bit in this photo would increase the drama a bit.  Also, maybe if you were just a little closer to the action...<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'I like black and whites and I plan to try to incorporate that into challenges in the future myself.  I like the action in this shot.  I would like it better if the skater was not centered in the frame.... Subject orientation to the upper left a bit in this photo would increase the drama a bit.  Also, maybe if you were just a little closer to the action...Nice shot!', '2002-04-15 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49293, 904, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the original colors in the scene, but I''m guessing that using grayscale helps emphasize the foreground over an otherwise brighter background.</td>', 'I don''t know the original colors in the scene, but I''m guessing that using grayscale helps emphasize the foreground over an otherwise brighter background.', '2002-04-15 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49294, 904, 527, '<td valign="top">I know this place. I have some very similar shots myself. Maybe you could have gotten lower to try to get a skater against the bright sky instead of the similarily shaded background as the boy''s shirt.</td>', 'I know this place. I have some very similar shots myself. Maybe you could have gotten lower to try to get a skater against the bright sky instead of the similarily shaded background as the boy''s shirt.', '2002-04-15 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49295, 904, 661, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped it more.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped it more.', '2002-04-15 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49296, 904, 724, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2002-04-15 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49297, 904, 113, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow under the jumper.  It adds to the photo.  I might have cropped it.  Less sky and less track.  Like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like the shadow under the jumper.  It adds to the photo.  I might have cropped it.  Less sky and less track.  Like the B&W.', '2002-04-16 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49298, 904, 301, '<td valign="top">nice.  being in b+w seems to concentrate the pic firmly on the skater ... away from (probably) distracting signs in the background.  One question ... did he land it? :)</td>', 'nice.  being in b+w seems to concentrate the pic firmly on the skater ... away from (probably) distracting signs in the background.  One question ... did he land it? :)', '2002-04-16 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49299, 904, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the boarder gets a little lost in the background, he may of stood out more if it was a color shot.</td>', 'Nice shot but the boarder gets a little lost in the background, he may of stood out more if it was a color shot.', '2002-04-16 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49300, 904, 640, '<td valign="top">the background distracts from the main object</td>', 'the background distracts from the main object', '2002-04-16 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49301, 904, 1066, '<td valign="top">Truly great photo.  Normally you might think the background would distract but in this photo it is an integral part of the mood.  The fence and the billboards and th buildings in the back give it the urban feel needed.  Great shadow, great contrast and exposure.  I love the way the skateboarders clothes came out all black to silouhette him against the background.  Maybe a lower angle on the skateboarder to great contrast his body against the sky but thats nit picking and you might lose the shadow on the ground and the nice contrast of the concrete.  One of my top 3 and a beautiful composition.</td>', 'Truly great photo.  Normally you might think the background would distract but in this photo it is an integral part of the mood.  The fence and the billboards and th buildings in the back give it the urban feel needed.  Great shadow, great contrast and exposure.  I love the way the skateboarders clothes came out all black to silouhette him against the background.  Maybe a lower angle on the skateboarder to great contrast his body against the sky but thats nit picking and you might lose the shadow on the ground and the nice contrast of the concrete.  One of my top 3 and a beautiful composition.', '2002-04-16 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49302, 904, 2, '<td valign="top">A lower angle might have made this shot more interesting -- and it would have made your friend look higher too :)<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE:  Borders and blank space are not allowed to pad your image.  Your photo will not be disqualified this challenge, but future entries that violate the rules will be.</td>', 'A lower angle might have made this shot more interesting -- and it would have made your friend look higher too :)PLEASE NOTE:  Borders and blank space are not allowed to pad your image.  Your photo will not be disqualified this challenge, but future entries that violate the rules will be.', '2002-04-16 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49303, 904, 142, '<td valign="top">You captured the skateboarder very well.  I think that if you pulled in closer to the subject the background would not be as distracting.  Overall, a very nice photo.</td>', 'You captured the skateboarder very well.  I think that if you pulled in closer to the subject the background would not be as distracting.  Overall, a very nice photo.', '2002-04-16 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49304, 904, 378, '<td valign="top">The skater seems to get lost in the background</td>', 'The skater seems to get lost in the background', '2002-04-16 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49305, 904, 441, '<td valign="top">well captured but background detracts from image</td>', 'well captured but background detracts from image', '2002-04-16 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49306, 904, 1064, '<td valign="top">lovely blackandwhite.</td>', 'lovely blackandwhite.', '2002-04-16 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49307, 904, 205, '<td valign="top">One thing I do when photographing rookie skaters is I get down close to the ground to make it look like their trick is bigger than it actually is, getting down lower may have also help you with your background issue, I like how the shadow is in the shot, very nice.</td>', 'One thing I do when photographing rookie skaters is I get down close to the ground to make it look like their trick is bigger than it actually is, getting down lower may have also help you with your background issue, I like how the shadow is in the shot, very nice.', '2002-04-16 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49308, 904, 910, '<td valign="top">Like it.  This is the skate park by the Seattle Center, right?</td>', 'Like it.  This is the skate park by the Seattle Center, right?', '2002-04-16 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49309, 904, 472, '<td valign="top">this would be cooler if the kid werent ''lost'' in the busiest part of the pic. too bad he didnt wear white.  kudos for sharp focus and good exposure.</td>', 'this would be cooler if the kid werent ''lost'' in the busiest part of the pic. too bad he didnt wear white.  kudos for sharp focus and good exposure.', '2002-04-17 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49310, 904, 749, '<td valign="top">The skater feels almost hidden in amoungst the signs and houses.</td>', 'The skater feels almost hidden in amoungst the signs and houses.', '2002-04-17 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49311, 904, 671, '<td valign="top">great stop action.  I like the shadow.  Too bad his hand isn''t more clearly defined by a less busy background.  Good shot!</td>', 'great stop action.  I like the shadow.  Too bad his hand isn''t more clearly defined by a less busy background.  Good shot!', '2002-04-18 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49312, 904, 543, '<td valign="top">Subject gets lost in the busy background.  Good shadow, tho.</td>', 'Subject gets lost in the busy background.  Good shadow, tho.', '2002-04-18 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49313, 904, 280, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, nice depth of field also.</td>', 'I like the shadow, nice depth of field also.', '2002-04-18 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49314, 904, 933, '<td valign="top">Kind of hard to make out the subject against that background.  Maybe a different angle and/or tighter cropping?</td>', 'Kind of hard to make out the subject against that background.  Maybe a different angle and/or tighter cropping?', '2002-04-18 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49315, 904, 1141, '<td valign="top">I like the picture</td>', 'I like the picture', '2002-04-18 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49316, 904, 714, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you had a different background I could see the subject a little better.</td>', 'Maybe if you had a different background I could see the subject a little better.', '2002-04-18 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49317, 904, 446, '<td valign="top">I admire anyone willing to try their hand a black and white.  Tough task requiring a good eye for contrast and shading.    This one seems especially tough to pull off with the busy backgroulnd.  Good effort.</td>', 'I admire anyone willing to try their hand a black and white.  Tough task requiring a good eye for contrast and shading.    This one seems especially tough to pull off with the busy backgroulnd.  Good effort.', '2002-04-18 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49318, 904, 245, '<td valign="top">i love the composition of the concrete and the black an white works great, but the skater is a little lost in the background.</td>', 'i love the composition of the concrete and the black an white works great, but the skater is a little lost in the background.', '2002-04-19 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49319, 904, 797, '<td valign="top">black and white is good. use of shadow to show flight is also very smart. thanks.</td>', 'black and white is good. use of shadow to show flight is also very smart. thanks.', '2002-04-19 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49320, 904, 811, '<td valign="top">A different perspective showing his face might have made it more effective.  At first, I didn''t like all the stuff in the background, taking a second look, I think it might add to the picture, especially since it is black and white and the skater is in dark clothes.  A color shot might have been too busy.</td>', 'A different perspective showing his face might have made it more effective.  At first, I didn''t like all the stuff in the background, taking a second look, I think it might add to the picture, especially since it is black and white and the skater is in dark clothes.  A color shot might have been too busy.', '2002-04-19 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49321, 904, 361, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy--I lose the skater. Would it have been better in color?  I like the shadow.</td>', 'The background is too busy--I lose the skater. Would it have been better in color?  I like the shadow.', '2002-04-19 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49322, 904, 1175, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this image.  I like the skater in the air, the shadow completly seperated.  The background works well too.  The only thing I could think of to make this look better would be to take it from a lower angle to get more contrast between the skater and the background.</td>', 'I really enjoy this image.  I like the skater in the air, the shadow completly seperated.  The background works well too.  The only thing I could think of to make this look better would be to take it from a lower angle to get more contrast between the skater and the background.', '2002-04-19 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49323, 904, 739, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, but this is a bad choice for a B&amp;W shot because the skater blends into the background.  You''ll need better contrast and lighting to pull off a B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like the shadow, but this is a bad choice for a B&W shot because the skater blends into the background.  You''ll need better contrast and lighting to pull off a B&W.', '2002-04-20 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49324, 904, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W, but I have trouble picking subject out of the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Nice B/W, but I have trouble picking subject out of the rest of the picture.', '2002-04-20 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49325, 904, 1, '<td valign="top">A different view of the skater might''ve been more dramatic.  He doesn''t look like he''s doing a really big trick, so maybe a lower angle would''ve made him look higher.</td>', 'A different view of the skater might''ve been more dramatic.  He doesn''t look like he''s doing a really big trick, so maybe a lower angle would''ve made him look higher.', '2002-04-21 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49326, 904, 806, '<td valign="top">blends in with background.</td>', 'blends in with background.', '2002-04-21 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49327, 912, 509, '<td valign="top">nice expression</td>', 'nice expression', '2002-04-15 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49328, 912, 813, '<td valign="top">Very good action. Good composition and spirit!</td>', 'Very good action. Good composition and spirit!', '2002-04-15 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49329, 912, 139, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression.  I would have had the jumper wear a different shirt, something of uniform color.</td>', 'Great facial expression.  I would have had the jumper wear a different shirt, something of uniform color.', '2002-04-15 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49330, 912, 656, '<td valign="top">Cool angle - but the phone lines are distracting.  Great expression.</td>', 'Cool angle - but the phone lines are distracting.  Great expression.', '2002-04-15 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49331, 912, 641, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion shot, but cropping the bottom a little tighter would be my thoughts.</td>', 'Good stop motion shot, but cropping the bottom a little tighter would be my thoughts.', '2002-04-15 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49332, 912, 279, '<td valign="top">Good choice to leave lots of space at the bottom.</td>', 'Good choice to leave lots of space at the bottom.', '2002-04-15 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49333, 912, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice stopped motion shot too.  I would like it a little better if there was a little breathing space at the top of the photo.  The hand is right on the edge of the frame.  Good work!</td>', 'This is a nice stopped motion shot too.  I would like it a little better if there was a little breathing space at the top of the photo.  The hand is right on the edge of the frame.  Good work!', '2002-04-15 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49334, 912, 92, '<td valign="top">If against a better background this would be awesome. Like against JUST a nice blue sky. It would have a lot more effect:)</td>', 'If against a better background this would be awesome. Like against JUST a nice blue sky. It would have a lot more effect:)', '2002-04-15 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49335, 912, 1077, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2002-04-15 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49336, 912, 361, '<td valign="top">Good action. Nice that the background behind the person is the sky and not the trees.</td>', 'Good action. Nice that the background behind the person is the sky and not the trees.', '2002-04-16 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49337, 912, 308, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of height that this image gives.</td>', 'I like the sense of height that this image gives.', '2002-04-16 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49338, 912, 441, '<td valign="top">good shot well caught, stopped dead and framed up close with good exposure</td>', 'good shot well caught, stopped dead and framed up close with good exposure', '2002-04-17 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49339, 912, 301, '<td valign="top">love that face.  Great not knowing where he''s headed either ... good also that you got low to the ground to take the pic - creates an interesting angle</td>', 'love that face.  Great not knowing where he''s headed either ... good also that you got low to the ground to take the pic - creates an interesting angle', '2002-04-17 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49340, 912, 472, '<td valign="top">fairly typical subject. the goofy look on the guy''s face gets an extra point.</td>', 'fairly typical subject. the goofy look on the guy''s face gets an extra point.', '2002-04-17 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49341, 912, 811, '<td valign="top">"It''s all in how you hold your face." :-)<br/>It might have been more effective if you had more "space" at the top of the picture.</td>', '"It''s all in how you hold your face." :-)It might have been more effective if you had more "space" at the top of the picture.', '2002-04-17 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49342, 912, 142, '<td valign="top">That expression is priceless!  Good entry.</td>', 'That expression is priceless!  Good entry.', '2002-04-17 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49343, 912, 1132, '<td valign="top">I especially like the expression on the guy''s face. Good job getting the jumper in focus.</td>', 'I especially like the expression on the guy''s face. Good job getting the jumper in focus.', '2002-04-17 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49344, 912, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture, and nice framing!</td>', 'Very cool picture, and nice framing!', '2002-04-18 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
