(49346, 912, 587, '<td valign="top">I hear the music for the ''billion dollar man'' in the back of my mind, great facial expression :) good centering.</td>', 'I hear the music for the ''billion dollar man'' in the back of my mind, great facial expression :) good centering.', '2002-04-18 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49347, 912, 933, '<td valign="top">The composition could be better - the guy is too near the top of the image.</td>', 'The composition could be better - the guy is too near the top of the image.', '2002-04-18 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49348, 912, 739, '<td valign="top">He seems a bit scared. :)</td>', 'He seems a bit scared. :)', '2002-04-19 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49349, 912, 245, '<td valign="top">the colors are kind of muted, pumping the contrast might make it pop more</td>', 'the colors are kind of muted, pumping the contrast might make it pop more', '2002-04-19 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49350, 912, 797, '<td valign="top">haha! nice stop action.</td>', 'haha! nice stop action.', '2002-04-19 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49351, 912, 1175, '<td valign="top">Is that Mr. Bean?  You satisfy the topic very well.  I think the key to making this a better image would be to change the background.</td>', 'Is that Mr. Bean?  You satisfy the topic very well.  I think the key to making this a better image would be to change the background.', '2002-04-19 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49352, 912, 113, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s standing tip toe on the telephone wires.  It looks as though he was put into the photo, but what do I know.</td>', 'Looks like he''s standing tip toe on the telephone wires.  It looks as though he was put into the photo, but what do I know.', '2002-04-20 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49353, 912, 1, '<td valign="top">Quite the frightened look you caught on this boy''s face.</td>', 'Quite the frightened look you caught on this boy''s face.', '2002-04-20 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49354, 912, 637, '<td valign="top">good  catch but too much distracting in the background</td>', 'good  catch but too much distracting in the background', '2002-04-20 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49355, 912, 889, '<td valign="top">he could be climbing an invisible ladder to get away from a mythic beast.</td>', 'he could be climbing an invisible ladder to get away from a mythic beast.', '2002-04-21 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49356, 912, 806, '<td valign="top">little blurrs, but good.</td>', 'little blurrs, but good.', '2002-04-21 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49357, 916, 92, '<td valign="top">Just WOW ! I love the color and the light sparkles that give this life. Nice capture:)</td>', 'Just WOW ! I love the color and the light sparkles that give this life. Nice capture:)', '2002-04-15 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49358, 916, 656, '<td valign="top">Looks like an interesting subject, but it seems too dark/ under exposed so it is hard to tell.</td>', 'Looks like an interesting subject, but it seems too dark/ under exposed so it is hard to tell.', '2002-04-15 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49359, 916, 1055, '<td valign="top">this is awesome.  great job</td>', 'this is awesome.  great job', '2002-04-15 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49360, 916, 641, '<td valign="top">I like the sparkles, and the composition. But I can''t really tell what exactly it is.</td>', 'I like the sparkles, and the composition. But I can''t really tell what exactly it is.', '2002-04-15 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49361, 916, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I''m wondering what exactly the fluid is.  Lens flare works.</td>', 'Nice shot, I''m wondering what exactly the fluid is.  Lens flare works.', '2002-04-16 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49362, 916, 640, '<td valign="top">Is it water?</td>', 'Is it water?', '2002-04-16 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49363, 916, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  I tried a shot similar to this and couldn''t quite come up with what I was looking for.  I was pouring two streams together and trying to catch the instersection of the two.  You also got some nice flash glares in the stream.  Do me a favor... tell me what i''m seeing in the reflections in this stream!  Good shot....</td>', 'Nice work!  I tried a shot similar to this and couldn''t quite come up with what I was looking for.  I was pouring two streams together and trying to catch the instersection of the two.  You also got some nice flash glares in the stream.  Do me a favor... tell me what i''m seeing in the reflections in this stream!  Good shot....', '2002-04-16 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49364, 916, 142, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This looks like motor oil.  I like the way you have captured the points of light.</td>', 'Very nice.  This looks like motor oil.  I like the way you have captured the points of light.', '2002-04-16 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49365, 916, 714, '<td valign="top">What?,  I have been looking at this for awhile and can''t figure it out.  Help! It looks like little bubble fairies flying around a tree or maybe the wood is transforming into something right before our eyes. lol. Nice and clear.  I think it is cool.  Keeps people guessing.</td>', 'What?,  I have been looking at this for awhile and can''t figure it out.  Help! It looks like little bubble fairies flying around a tree or maybe the wood is transforming into something right before our eyes. lol. Nice and clear.  I think it is cool.  Keeps people guessing.', '2002-04-16 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49366, 916, 748, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to figure this one out. Is the bronze stuff fluid too?</td>', 'I can''t seem to figure this one out. Is the bronze stuff fluid too?', '2002-04-16 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49367, 916, 813, '<td valign="top">wierd, but interesting, still it needs something more to be a complete picture</td>', 'wierd, but interesting, still it needs something more to be a complete picture', '2002-04-16 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49368, 916, 734, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot,.. it would make a nice background for a pc.. I just keep wondering what im looking at.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot,.. it would make a nice background for a pc.. I just keep wondering what im looking at.', '2002-04-16 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49369, 916, 798, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the different color of whatever liquid that is. Is it water? If so good job, if not do tell.</td>', 'I appreciate the different color of whatever liquid that is. Is it water? If so good job, if not do tell.', '2002-04-17 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49370, 916, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful abstract.</td>', 'beautiful abstract.', '2002-04-17 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49371, 916, 441, '<td valign="top">flowing bodyparts! - I get similar marks like the  surrounding white spots when I catch the tripod when shooting stars-great clouration</td>', 'flowing bodyparts! - I get similar marks like the  surrounding white spots when I catch the tripod when shooting stars-great clouration', '2002-04-17 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49372, 916, 749, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colour, and the droplets look like they''re floating past the lens.</td>', 'Gorgeous colour, and the droplets look like they''re floating past the lens.', '2002-04-17 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
