(49411, 917, 1132, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and motion captured here. I don''t mind the tight cropping. I think it works. I think what caught my eye the most is the position of the right hand.  It leads my eye into the rest of the picture, while the other diagonals keep my eye moving.</td>', 'I like the colors and motion captured here. I don''t mind the tight cropping. I think it works. I think what caught my eye the most is the position of the right hand.  It leads my eye into the rest of the picture, while the other diagonals keep my eye moving.', '2002-04-17 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
