(49436, 917, 1240, '<td valign="top">A real beauty!</td>', 'A real beauty!', '2002-04-21 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49437, 917, 656, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all the people who voted and commented.  This was me juggling, as well as taking the photo.  Took a bit of running back and forth to trigger the timer, juggle in an ''imaginary'' frame and try to get the shot.  I have several with all the pins in the shot, but I liked this more dynamic, cropped version.  Seems a lot of people wanted to see the whole thing!  I also screwed up and had the camera in ISO 200 mode, hence the noise and the background isn''t the best, but I needed something to give me a clue where the camera was pointing!</td>', 'Thanks to all the people who voted and commented.  This was me juggling, as well as taking the photo.  Took a bit of running back and forth to trigger the timer, juggle in an ''imaginary'' frame and try to get the shot.  I have several with all the pins in the shot, but I liked this more dynamic, cropped version.  Seems a lot of people wanted to see the whole thing!  I also screwed up and had the camera in ISO 200 mode, hence the noise and the background isn''t the best, but I needed something to give me a clue where the camera was pointing!', '2002-04-22 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49438, 917, 472, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture would do a lot better</td>', 'I thought this picture would do a lot better', '2002-04-22 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
