(49510, 920, 1079, '<td valign="top">What is it?</td>', 'What is it?', '2002-04-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49511, 920, 772, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I have spent a lot of time looking at this... It''s an excellent shot.  The top part of the image is a little out of focus.  I''m bothered by the vertical lines in the image... I don''t know why they are there.  If they are there because of a scanner, then shame.  If they were put there intentionally, then why?  I thought for a moment that they may be part of a background but I can see them in the top part of the water as well and through the water....  I''ll wait to see what happens on this one.  If it stays, it''s getting a decent score.  Improvements would have been tighter focus on the top and removal of those verticals....</td>', 'Ok.. I have spent a lot of time looking at this... It''s an excellent shot.  The top part of the image is a little out of focus.  I''m bothered by the vertical lines in the image... I don''t know why they are there.  If they are there because of a scanner, then shame.  If they were put there intentionally, then why?  I thought for a moment that they may be part of a background but I can see them in the top part of the water as well and through the water....  I''ll wait to see what happens on this one.  If it stays, it''s getting a decent score.  Improvements would have been tighter focus on the top and removal of those verticals....', '2002-04-15 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49512, 920, 782, '<td valign="top">Interesting Photo</td>', 'Interesting Photo', '2002-04-15 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
