(49578, 922, 472, '<td valign="top">it''s a cutie! only prob is there isnt a lot of separation between the parts of the cat, so you have too look sort of hard to see what''s happening</td>', 'it''s a cutie! only prob is there isnt a lot of separation between the parts of the cat, so you have too look sort of hard to see what''s happening', '2002-04-17 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1);
