(49579, 922, 933, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of motion stopped on this one.   Still, an oddly interesting shot.  Nice composition, but too much of the same color.</td>', 'Not a lot of motion stopped on this one.   Still, an oddly interesting shot.  Nice composition, but too much of the same color.', '2002-04-17 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49580, 922, 587, '<td valign="top">Cleansing or napping? ;)  A shot with its tongue sticking out would have helped the ''stopped motion'' concept for me.</td>', 'Cleansing or napping? ;)  A shot with its tongue sticking out would have helped the ''stopped motion'' concept for me.', '2002-04-17 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49581, 922, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m basically lost in the hair -- some point of reference in the photo might help ... unless you were aiming for the confusion.</td>', 'I''m basically lost in the hair -- some point of reference in the photo might help ... unless you were aiming for the confusion.', '2002-04-18 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49582, 922, 205, '<td valign="top">A cat cleaning itself is almost motionless.</td>', 'A cat cleaning itself is almost motionless.', '2002-04-18 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49583, 922, 330, '<td valign="top">Cute! Sorry I don''t see much action may have been better if you could see the tongue.</td>', 'Cute! Sorry I don''t see much action may have been better if you could see the tongue.', '2002-04-18 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49584, 922, 245, '<td valign="top">cleansing, or sleeping? i know you stopped the motion, but it doesn''t read ''stopped motion'' to me.</td>', 'cleansing, or sleeping? i know you stopped the motion, but it doesn''t read ''stopped motion'' to me.', '2002-04-18 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49585, 922, 1164, '<td valign="top">What motion was stopped?</td>', 'What motion was stopped?', '2002-04-18 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49586, 922, 1141, '<td valign="top">What is this? Very busy and confusing!</td>', 'What is this? Very busy and confusing!', '2002-04-18 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49587, 922, 1041, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, I also love taking macro shots of my cats.  This one''s too busy for my liking though.</td>', 'Neat idea, I also love taking macro shots of my cats.  This one''s too busy for my liking though.', '2002-04-19 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49588, 922, 797, '<td valign="top">the colors and detail comes out nicely.</td>', 'the colors and detail comes out nicely.', '2002-04-19 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49589, 922, 1175, '<td valign="top">Very furry.  Doesn''t work for this topic.</td>', 'Very furry.  Doesn''t work for this topic.', '2002-04-19 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49590, 922, 142, '<td valign="top">I wish you had pulled back a little so we could see the kitty better.  Is it a Persian?</td>', 'I wish you had pulled back a little so we could see the kitty better.  Is it a Persian?', '2002-04-19 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49591, 922, 1202, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the stopped motion here.</td>', 'I don''t see the stopped motion here.', '2002-04-20 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49592, 922, 1, '<td valign="top">It just seems like a large ball of fur, where nothing is really distinct.</td>', 'It just seems like a large ball of fur, where nothing is really distinct.', '2002-04-21 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49593, 922, 806, '<td valign="top">the face blends into the rest of the picture.</td>', 'the face blends into the rest of the picture.', '2002-04-21 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49594, 922, 113, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty.  There seems to be a couple of blur spots but  the photo is a nice calming one.</td>', 'Pretty kitty.  There seems to be a couple of blur spots but  the photo is a nice calming one.', '2002-04-21 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49595, 923, 656, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but not very exciting as a photograph.  Too blue!</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but not very exciting as a photograph.  Too blue!', '2002-04-15 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49596, 923, 641, '<td valign="top">The colors and the water rings really make this shot.</td>', 'The colors and the water rings really make this shot.', '2002-04-15 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49597, 923, 772, '<td valign="top">The stopped motion in this photograph is fine.  Focus and depth of field are fine too.  As I was reading through some of the forums on this site when I first joined, I read some discussion about the Rule of Thirds.  You may want to investigate this because it would have improved this photograph significantly.  If you had placed that drain on one of the lower half intersecting lines, the impact of the shot would have been much greater.  Look up "The Rule of Thirds" and see if you agree :)</td>', 'The stopped motion in this photograph is fine.  Focus and depth of field are fine too.  As I was reading through some of the forums on this site when I first joined, I read some discussion about the Rule of Thirds.  You may want to investigate this because it would have improved this photograph significantly.  If you had placed that drain on one of the lower half intersecting lines, the impact of the shot would have been much greater.  Look up "The Rule of Thirds" and see if you agree :)', '2002-04-15 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49598, 923, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2002-04-15 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49599, 923, 189, '<td valign="top">Water, Water Everywhere !</td>', 'Water, Water Everywhere !', '2002-04-15 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49600, 923, 138, '<td valign="top">water.. go figure</td>', 'water.. go figure', '2002-04-15 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49601, 923, 885, '<td valign="top">i like the colors</td>', 'i like the colors', '2002-04-15 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49602, 923, 308, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  The rusty drain compliments the sink in a rather unique manner.  A++ TRANSACTION!!!</td>', 'I love the colors.  The rusty drain compliments the sink in a rather unique manner.  A++ TRANSACTION!!!', '2002-04-15 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49603, 923, 813, '<td valign="top">Wow. Good color and excellent freeze frame. Got distracted by the color of the drain. Is that rust or copper or what?</td>', 'Wow. Good color and excellent freeze frame. Got distracted by the color of the drain. Is that rust or copper or what?', '2002-04-15 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49604, 923, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice spiral shape!</td>', 'Nice spiral shape!', '2002-04-15 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49605, 923, 205, '<td valign="top">I like the spiinning effect, it almost looks like a whirl pool. Excellent job.</td>', 'I like the spiinning effect, it almost looks like a whirl pool. Excellent job.', '2002-04-16 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49606, 923, 524, '<td valign="top">nice shot, good effect</td>', 'nice shot, good effect', '2002-04-16 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49607, 923, 441, '<td valign="top">interesting well stopped,well focused and exposed shot, well caught.</td>', 'interesting well stopped,well focused and exposed shot, well caught.', '2002-04-17 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49608, 923, 472, '<td valign="top">niiice water textures and rotation</td>', 'niiice water textures and rotation', '2002-04-17 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49609, 923, 749, '<td valign="top">The colours really help sell this picture, and the timing on the ripples is spot on.</td>', 'The colours really help sell this picture, and the timing on the ripples is spot on.', '2002-04-17 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49610, 923, 933, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot. Interesting colors, decent composition.</td>', 'Not a bad shot. Interesting colors, decent composition.', '2002-04-17 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49611, 923, 587, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see more of the "splash" part, cropped more on left, less on right. good clarity on outer ring though.</td>', 'Would have liked to see more of the "splash" part, cropped more on left, less on right. good clarity on outer ring though.', '2002-04-17 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49612, 923, 2, '<td valign="top">The penny makes for a really cool color effect -- nice job.</td>', 'The penny makes for a really cool color effect -- nice job.', '2002-04-18 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49613, 923, 142, '<td valign="top">You captured th movement well.  Good job.</td>', 'You captured th movement well.  Good job.', '2002-04-18 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49614, 923, 739, '<td valign="top">Love the gradient of smaller to larger ripples and how it gets more and more volatile as the water moves outward.  Great shot!</td>', 'Love the gradient of smaller to larger ripples and how it gets more and more volatile as the water moves outward.  Great shot!', '2002-04-19 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49615, 923, 797, '<td valign="top">good gurgling and swirling picture. great shot.</td>', 'good gurgling and swirling picture. great shot.', '2002-04-19 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49616, 923, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture of motion -- what would it look like from different angles?</td>', 'Good capture of motion -- what would it look like from different angles?', '2002-04-19 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49617, 923, 1175, '<td valign="top">The water thing is way to over done.  I''m giving my better votes out to the more original pictures.</td>', 'The water thing is way to over done.  I''m giving my better votes out to the more original pictures.', '2002-04-19 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49618, 923, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the water.</td>', 'Nice capture of the water.', '2002-04-20 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49619, 923, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good stop action of another drain. compare your with "Down the Drain" and see which one leaves you the most imagination.</td>', 'Good stop action of another drain. compare your with "Down the Drain" and see which one leaves you the most imagination.', '2002-04-20 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49620, 923, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors here.  I would like it if the drain was centered though.</td>', 'Interesting colors here.  I would like it if the drain was centered though.', '2002-04-21 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49621, 923, 245, '<td valign="top">the colors of this sink add a lot to what would otherwise be just another water shot. i really like it!</td>', 'the colors of this sink add a lot to what would otherwise be just another water shot. i really like it!', '2002-04-22 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49622, 924, 157, '<td valign="top">ack! I can''t wait till I take out my bike!</td>', 'ack! I can''t wait till I take out my bike!', '2002-04-15 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49623, 924, 813, '<td valign="top">Right on, that''s the stuff! Great action, good composition, focus ect. Excellent job of fullfilling the criteria.</td>', 'Right on, that''s the stuff! Great action, good composition, focus ect. Excellent job of fullfilling the criteria.', '2002-04-15 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49624, 924, 205, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing motion trails</td>', 'I''m seeing motion trails', '2002-04-15 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49625, 924, 656, '<td valign="top">Like that you have the shadows on the ground.  Might have been stronger from a lower angle, to get them against the sky.</td>', 'Like that you have the shadows on the ground.  Might have been stronger from a lower angle, to get them against the sky.', '2002-04-15 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49626, 924, 641, '<td valign="top">Good compostion, just a little blurry.</td>', 'Good compostion, just a little blurry.', '2002-04-15 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49627, 924, 279, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic.</td>', 'Awesome pic.', '2002-04-15 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49628, 924, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  A slightly faster shutter speed would have frozen the tires and spokes a little better :)</td>', 'This is nice!  A slightly faster shutter speed would have frozen the tires and spokes a little better :)', '2002-04-15 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49629, 924, 748, '<td valign="top">Bet they would like to have this on their wall!</td>', 'Bet they would like to have this on their wall!', '2002-04-15 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49630, 924, 142, '<td valign="top">This photo looks good enough to put in a sports magazine.  Good job!</td>', 'This photo looks good enough to put in a sports magazine.  Good job!', '2002-04-15 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49631, 924, 441, '<td valign="top">wheels still spinning - good shot well composed but loses points for ot being stopped dead</td>', 'wheels still spinning - good shot well composed but loses points for ot being stopped dead', '2002-04-15 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49632, 924, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  You nailed the exposure.  I think it would have been even better shot from an angle to show a more appealling background.  Maybe shooting up from below?  Different part of the track?  I know that race photographers intentionally use a fast enough shutter speed to stop the body, but fast enough to hint at the wheels turning, but for this particular challenge you may have wanted a higher shutter speed to stop the wheels also?  Having said all of this, I still rated this photo very high.  I appreciate how difficult this type of shot can be.  My comments are meant t be constructive criticism.  Please take them in that light, as I like the photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  You nailed the exposure.  I think it would have been even better shot from an angle to show a more appealling background.  Maybe shooting up from below?  Different part of the track?  I know that race photographers intentionally use a fast enough shutter speed to stop the body, but fast enough to hint at the wheels turning, but for this particular challenge you may have wanted a higher shutter speed to stop the wheels also?  Having said all of this, I still rated this photo very high.  I appreciate how difficult this type of shot can be.  My comments are meant t be constructive criticism.  Please take them in that light, as I like the photo.  Nice job.', '2002-04-15 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49633, 924, 536, '<td valign="top">Nice. good job getting close and keeping both in frame.</td>', 'Nice. good job getting close and keeping both in frame.', '2002-04-15 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49634, 924, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, though the guys are a little blurry.  A faster shutter speed would''ve fixed this.</td>', 'Great shot, though the guys are a little blurry.  A faster shutter speed would''ve fixed this.', '2002-04-15 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49635, 924, 640, '<td valign="top">The wheels are hardly even blurry. Good work</td>', 'The wheels are hardly even blurry. Good work', '2002-04-16 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49636, 924, 301, '<td valign="top">lovely colours in this.  I think I would have liked to see just one of the riders, or more DOF (but that''s asking a lot from a tough shot in the first place).  Still one of my faves</td>', 'lovely colours in this.  I think I would have liked to see just one of the riders, or more DOF (but that''s asking a lot from a tough shot in the first place).  Still one of my faves', '2002-04-16 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49637, 924, 255, '<td valign="top">very cool shot!</td>', 'very cool shot!', '2002-04-16 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49638, 924, 361, '<td valign="top">Good focus. Can even see the individual spokes in the wheels! Nice photo.</td>', 'Good focus. Can even see the individual spokes in the wheels! Nice photo.', '2002-04-16 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49639, 924, 509, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  I''m not a bmx fan, but you did a really good job of catching the action here.  Who won?</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  I''m not a bmx fan, but you did a really good job of catching the action here.  Who won?', '2002-04-16 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49640, 924, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent sports shot!  nice composition with the 2 riders side by side</td>', 'excellent sports shot!  nice composition with the 2 riders side by side', '2002-04-17 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49641, 924, 749, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and good timing</td>', 'Nice composition, and good timing', '2002-04-17 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49642, 924, 1132, '<td valign="top">Sharp with good colors. Congrats!</td>', 'Sharp with good colors. Congrats!', '2002-04-17 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49643, 924, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot -- great subjects and colors.</td>', 'Awesome shot -- great subjects and colors.', '2002-04-18 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49644, 924, 587, '<td valign="top">great photo, not only 1 but 2!! Great ''stopped motion''! Wish bike #4 was as clear as #20 - one of my faves.</td>', 'great photo, not only 1 but 2!! Great ''stopped motion''! Wish bike #4 was as clear as #20 - one of my faves.', '2002-04-18 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49645, 924, 797, '<td valign="top">nice feeling of competition and speed. great work.</td>', 'nice feeling of competition and speed. great work.', '2002-04-19 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49646, 924, 811, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Another idea would be to zoom as much as possible, if possible, on one of the bikes so the eye doesn''t go back and forth.</td>', 'Good shot.  Another idea would be to zoom as much as possible, if possible, on one of the bikes so the eye doesn''t go back and forth.', '2002-04-19 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49647, 924, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice timing and photo ... still some slight blurring .. it looks like you could use a smaller f-stop and increase your shutter speed, if it can go faster.</td>', 'Nice timing and photo ... still some slight blurring .. it looks like you could use a smaller f-stop and increase your shutter speed, if it can go faster.', '2002-04-19 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49648, 924, 889, '<td valign="top">Great depth of view with noting too distracting in the background.</td>', 'Great depth of view with noting too distracting in the background.', '2002-04-19 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49649, 924, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s a great picture.</td>', 'That''s a great picture.', '2002-04-20 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49650, 924, 1202, '<td valign="top">Right idea of a good old stanby subject.  Quite a lot of blurr.</td>', 'Right idea of a good old stanby subject.  Quite a lot of blurr.', '2002-04-20 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49651, 924, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice action!</td>', 'Nice action!', '2002-04-21 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49652, 924, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2002-04-21 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49653, 924, 113, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Depth is good.  Compsition is good.  My son used to race these.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Depth is good.  Compsition is good.  My son used to race these.', '2002-04-21 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49654, 924, 245, '<td valign="top">Great timing! I wish the shadow on the second bike wasn''t right on/under the flags, otehr than that this picture is sweet.</td>', 'Great timing! I wish the shadow on the second bike wasn''t right on/under the flags, otehr than that this picture is sweet.', '2002-04-22 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49655, 925, 107, '<td valign="top">the colours are good, and it''s very patriotic.</td>', 'the colours are good, and it''s very patriotic.', '2002-04-15 06:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49656, 925, 138, '<td valign="top">enough political shots.. this country is the cause of all we get.</td>', 'enough political shots.. this country is the cause of all we get.', '2002-04-15 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49657, 925, 1055, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture, but a bit cliche.  I like the ominous feeling of the clouds in the background rather than a blue sky, however.</td>', 'this is a great picture, but a bit cliche.  I like the ominous feeling of the clouds in the background rather than a blue sky, however.', '2002-04-15 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49658, 925, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t this get the automatic ''1'' rating for being an american flag ? :)  Good framing, nice and close.  Also a nice clean background.  Still a bit blurred due to motion though - a faster shutter speed might have helped.</td>', 'Doesn''t this get the automatic ''1'' rating for being an american flag ? :)  Good framing, nice and close.  Also a nice clean background.  Still a bit blurred due to motion though - a faster shutter speed might have helped.', '2002-04-15 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49659, 925, 509, '<td valign="top">You''re most likely gonna get blasted for the patriotic theme, but this is a good shot of a good flag</td>', 'You''re most likely gonna get blasted for the patriotic theme, but this is a good shot of a good flag', '2002-04-15 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49660, 925, 92, '<td valign="top">heh what could be better than our flag? Great choice. I only see a little bit of blur here and there but good capture all the same:)</td>', 'heh what could be better than our flag? Great choice. I only see a little bit of blur here and there but good capture all the same:)', '2002-04-15 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49661, 925, 139, '<td valign="top">It''s motion, but not much more.</td>', 'It''s motion, but not much more.', '2002-04-15 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49662, 925, 772, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... flags and crosses... flags and crosses.. I think I read how I was supposed to vote o this somewhere... lol.. anyway...  Composition here is great.  I need one of these on my wall at work.  I am struggling with ''stopped motion'' on this one.  I''m not sure that it''s the best subject for stopped motion.  It is a good subject, but I''m begging for better.  I love the photo, composition, and technical pieces, but I''m still begging for a better ''stopped motion'' subject.</td>', 'Hmmm... flags and crosses... flags and crosses.. I think I read how I was supposed to vote o this somewhere... lol.. anyway...  Composition here is great.  I need one of these on my wall at work.  I am struggling with ''stopped motion'' on this one.  I''m not sure that it''s the best subject for stopped motion.  It is a good subject, but I''m begging for better.  I love the photo, composition, and technical pieces, but I''m still begging for a better ''stopped motion'' subject.', '2002-04-15 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49663, 925, 189, '<td valign="top">OOh America! If I don''t give it a TEN i''m a terrorist!</td>', 'OOh America! If I don''t give it a TEN i''m a terrorist!', '2002-04-15 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49664, 925, 641, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what anyone says. I love shots of our flag, and this one is a great one!</td>', 'I don''t care what anyone says. I love shots of our flag, and this one is a great one!', '2002-04-15 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49665, 925, 203, '<td valign="top">Boy am I glad I pulled my version of this.  Even the poles are similar but the wind was blowing the other way in mine.  Yours has motion blur on the top red stripe at the end.</td>', 'Boy am I glad I pulled my version of this.  Even the poles are similar but the wind was blowing the other way in mine.  Yours has motion blur on the top red stripe at the end.', '2002-04-15 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49666, 925, 714, '<td valign="top">I also tried this and my did''nt come out as nicely as yours.</td>', 'I also tried this and my did''nt come out as nicely as yours.', '2002-04-15 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49667, 925, 661, '<td valign="top">Great Colors!</td>', 'Great Colors!', '2002-04-15 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49668, 925, 910, '<td valign="top">nice angle of the flag pole</td>', 'nice angle of the flag pole', '2002-04-16 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49669, 925, 117, '<td valign="top">i take a lot pictures of our flag, i guess since sept. it has been meaning a lot more to everyone</td>', 'i take a lot pictures of our flag, i guess since sept. it has been meaning a lot more to everyone', '2002-04-16 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49670, 925, 640, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, good focus, colors</td>', 'Technically very good, good focus, colors', '2002-04-16 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49671, 925, 352, '<td valign="top">Very good! Crisp details, good job!  (and bold to take a flag pic... ;)</td>', 'Very good! Crisp details, good job!  (and bold to take a flag pic... ;)', '2002-04-16 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49672, 925, 142, '<td valign="top">I give higher scores to flags and crosses.  This is beautiful.  It makes me want to stand up  a sing the National Anthem.</td>', 'I give higher scores to flags and crosses.  This is beautiful.  It makes me want to stand up  a sing the National Anthem.', '2002-04-16 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
