(49674, 925, 446, '<td valign="top">I pledge allegience.....   Good job.  Very appropriate for the times.  You caght it in all of its glory against the sky.</td>', 'I pledge allegience.....   Good job.  Very appropriate for the times.  You caght it in all of its glory against the sky.', '2002-04-16 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
