(49681, 925, 205, '<td valign="top">Another one of those damn flag pictures, and its on a pole, and you can see the whole flag, don''t know how many times I''ve had to look at this. I can think of a million other ways of taking a creative flag picture. 1 get one of those hot chicks to wear an american flag bikini, 2 have the flag in free flight, 3 put it in a shredder, 4 Use a different countries or use that skull and crossbones one, 5 put it in water, 6 burn it, 7 close up for graphical detail, 8 get so many flags in huge pile that you don''t know what to do wtiht them and decide eh that''d make a good picture, 9 have somebody stab anthor person with the flag pole( I think that shot won a pulitzer) 10. Have someone run with it.</td>', 'Another one of those damn flag pictures, and its on a pole, and you can see the whole flag, don''t know how many times I''ve had to look at this. I can think of a million other ways of taking a creative flag picture. 1 get one of those hot chicks to wear an american flag bikini, 2 have the flag in free flight, 3 put it in a shredder, 4 Use a different countries or use that skull and crossbones one, 5 put it in water, 6 burn it, 7 close up for graphical detail, 8 get so many flags in huge pile that you don''t know what to do wtiht them and decide eh that''d make a good picture, 9 have somebody stab anthor person with the flag pole( I think that shot won a pulitzer) 10. Have someone run with it.', '2002-04-18 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
