(49699, 925, 671, '<td valign="top">Very nice flag picture.  The blue sky background makes the colors look really nice.  Good focus.</td>', 'Very nice flag picture.  The blue sky background makes the colors look really nice.  Good focus.', '2002-05-07 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(49700, 926, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Would have loved it if you were a lot closer, and the frame was horizontal.<br/><br/>Nice and sharp for the droplets.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice!  Would have loved it if you were a lot closer, and the frame was horizontal.Nice and sharp for the droplets.  Good job.', '2002-04-15 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49701, 926, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like this splash.  There isn''t much I can criticize on this photograph.  The small bubble on the lower portion of the frame adds a lot to this shot.  Maybe the only comment I could make is that the splash is dead center in the photograph.  I wonder if it would have been more dramatic if it had been placed off center.  It would have also been interesting to see a closer crop so that the splash occupies a larger portion of the frame.  Great work!</td>', 'Very nice!  I like this splash.  There isn''t much I can criticize on this photograph.  The small bubble on the lower portion of the frame adds a lot to this shot.  Maybe the only comment I could make is that the splash is dead center in the photograph.  I wonder if it would have been more dramatic if it had been placed off center.  It would have also been interesting to see a closer crop so that the splash occupies a larger portion of the frame.  Great work!', '2002-04-15 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49702, 926, 813, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Perfect timing, sharp focus, interesting composition. How many shots did it take to get this?</td>', 'Excellent! Perfect timing, sharp focus, interesting composition. How many shots did it take to get this?', '2002-04-15 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
