(49737, 927, 446, '<td valign="top">Fine effort.  Wish I did not have to look through the fence.  It must have been tough to get a high enough shutter speed to stop the ball yet a wide enough aperture for the depth of field.  Nice work.</td>', 'Fine effort.  Wish I did not have to look through the fence.  It must have been tough to get a high enough shutter speed to stop the ball yet a wide enough aperture for the depth of field.  Nice work.', '2002-04-15 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
