(49739, 927, 245, '<td valign="top">Ii wish you hadn''t been behind the fence, it was probably safer that way, though. :) Try framing it vertically to crop away most of the background and focus on the action.</td>', 'Ii wish you hadn''t been behind the fence, it was probably safer that way, though. :) Try framing it vertically to crop away most of the background and focus on the action.', '2002-04-16 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49740, 927, 301, '<td valign="top">this is really cool... i''ve read somewhere that if you get really close to the fence, and focus far away enough the wires will almost disappear.  Don''t know if you''d trust your pitcher''s arm enough to get the camera any closer :)  Well done</td>', 'this is really cool... i''ve read somewhere that if you get really close to the fence, and focus far away enough the wires will almost disappear.  Don''t know if you''d trust your pitcher''s arm enough to get the camera any closer :)  Well done', '2002-04-16 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
