(49742, 927, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, though a little zoom through the fence and the image would''ve been much better.  It would''ve look like the ball would have to hit us.</td>', 'Cool shot, though a little zoom through the fence and the image would''ve been much better.  It would''ve look like the ball would have to hit us.', '2002-04-16 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49743, 927, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!  It would have been cool if you could have framed and or cropped the picture to have the fence be symmetric on all sides of the image.</td>', 'Very cool idea!  It would have been cool if you could have framed and or cropped the picture to have the fence be symmetric on all sides of the image.', '2002-04-16 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49744, 927, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the idea to use the fence to frame both the pitcher and the ball. It would have liked it better if the ball would have been  positioned more towards the point were the wires cross.<br/>But I guess the pitcher wasn''t that good ;)<br/></td>', 'I like the idea to use the fence to frame both the pitcher and the ball. It would have liked it better if the ball would have been  positioned more towards the point were the wires cross.But I guess the pitcher wasn''t that good ;)', '2002-04-16 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(49745, 927, 689, '<td valign="top">The motion is stopped pretty well with the ball and the focus on it is good ... you might have tried getting rid of the fence somehow ... even putting the lens right up to an opening.</td>', 'The motion is stopped pretty well with the ball and the focus on it is good ... you might have tried getting rid of the fence somehow ... even putting the lens right up to an opening.', '2002-04-16 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
