(49747, 927, 811, '<td valign="top">Crop left and right sides to make subject more pronounced.    The stuff in the background is distracting.  Too bad there weren''t cars visible. (2 stopped actions.)  Part of me likes the fence, part of me doesn''t.</td>', 'Crop left and right sides to make subject more pronounced.    The stuff in the background is distracting.  Too bad there weren''t cars visible. (2 stopped actions.)  Part of me likes the fence, part of me doesn''t.', '2002-04-17 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
