(49760, 927, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice - the fence does the trick.   Location of the camera is perfect to have the guy exactly in the center of the square.   I would though have lost an inch or so from the right - to have the object right in the center.</td>', 'Nice - the fence does the trick.   Location of the camera is perfect to have the guy exactly in the center of the square.   I would though have lost an inch or so from the right - to have the object right in the center.', '2002-04-21 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
