(50058, 939, 797, '<td valign="top">i like the blizzard look though i suspect many will down-vote you for the dimness. and the stop action is lovely.</td>', 'i like the blizzard look though i suspect many will down-vote you for the dimness. and the stop action is lovely.', '2002-04-19 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
