(50136, 943, 1, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  As per your image, I think the fan should''ve been centered.  As per the subject, I think you should''ve found somethign else to stop.  :)</td>', 'Hmm.  As per your image, I think the fan should''ve been centered.  As per the subject, I think you should''ve found somethign else to stop.  :)', '2002-04-20 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
