(50145, 944, 641, '<td valign="top">Did my white kitty get out and go visit you? color is good and subject very cute.</td>', 'Did my white kitty get out and go visit you? color is good and subject very cute.', '2002-04-15 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50146, 944, 772, '<td valign="top">These are cute cats.  I like to photograph my cat as well.  My personal interpretation of a "stopped motion" challenge is to take something that is moving and freeze it in time so it appears to be standing still.  In order to accomplish this, I believe that the moving subject of the photograph should be moving at a rapid pace.  I''m sure these cats are not sitting still but my impression is that they could be.  I don''t FEEL motion in this photo.</td>', 'These are cute cats.  I like to photograph my cat as well.  My personal interpretation of a "stopped motion" challenge is to take something that is moving and freeze it in time so it appears to be standing still.  In order to accomplish this, I believe that the moving subject of the photograph should be moving at a rapid pace.  I''m sure these cats are not sitting still but my impression is that they could be.  I don''t FEEL motion in this photo.', '2002-04-15 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50147, 944, 656, '<td valign="top">That red-eye is evil!  Whole shot seems to have a pinkish cast, or have you dyed the white cat ? :)</td>', 'That red-eye is evil!  Whole shot seems to have a pinkish cast, or have you dyed the white cat ? :)', '2002-04-15 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
